-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11384"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-20T15:43:25-08:00","id":75923,"title":"","content":"After looking at the Guardians of the Galaxy trailer, I think my low expectations are so far justified. Yes, I do admit it looks like a fun time at the movies...so far. But, I'm looking for that cosmic tone that should fairly scream THANOS!!OMFG!1. And it isn't there. And what's with the dissing of Starlord? (those racist bastards, the Kree, had immense respect for this particular human) And for that matter, who the hell are those humans anyway? Maybe I'm missing something here. I'll go scrutinize it again.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>Mankind was once an endangered species. It will likely be so again. And mankind will only have itself to blame.</i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/144-shadowflame","name":"Shadowflame","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar144_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1223"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-20T15:50:49-08:00","id":75928,"title":"","content":"Well, considering Ultron's coming before Thanos, you might want to ease up a little.<br /> <br /> As for the dissing of Starlord, I don't care because I don't know. Ignorance, in this case, is sort of bliss.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Kelly R.S. Steele, Freelance Writer(Feel free to call me Kelly, Arcane, or Arc)</b><br /> The world is not beautiful, therefore it is.-Keiichi Sigsawa, Kino's Journey<br /> Feminine pronouns, please.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","name":"ArcaneArts","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar99_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11384"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-20T17:06:03-08:00","id":75962,"title":"","content":"Drax was fairly cosmic for the longest while. Then he underwent a change that took away his cosmic abilities. He became a super version of Wolverine, which in this movie he's supposed to be it seems. <a href=\"http://i1.ytimg.com/vi/rnAtqUp8y0g/0.jpg\" target=\"_blank\">This</a> is certainly not <a href=\"http://www.writeups.org/img/fiche/4545b.jpg\" target=\"_blank\">this</a>. And because this is Disney they have to kiddy-fy everything so they can market the toys, so we definitely won't see <a href=\"http://comicattack.net/wp-content/uploads/2010/07/78226-174267-drax-the-destroyer_super.jpg\" target=\"_blank\">any of this</a>. Starlord, Drax, Gamora...those characters have some serious comic-book history. I've accepted we won't be getting the comic-books. We won't see the stories that led to this epic ending that went from <a href=\"http://goodcomics.comicbookresources.com/wp-content/uploads/2013/06/avengers20.jpg\" target=\"_blank\">here</a> to <a href=\"http://www.leaderslair.com/marveluniverse/2in1an2.jpg\" target=\"_blank\">this</a> issue. I'd bet even money that Disney won't mention just how racist Ronan the Accuser is. (who I believe will make an appearance in this movie.)","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>Mankind was once an endangered species. It will likely be so again. And mankind will only have itself to blame.</i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/144-shadowflame","name":"Shadowflame","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar144_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1223"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-20T17:32:55-08:00","id":75979,"title":"","content":"Given that most of the profit for comic book movies over the past decade have come from the people who watch PG-13 movies, I don't think Disney is the sole evil at work here.<br /> <br /> Also, am I <i>supposed</i> to take comic book Drax seriously?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Kelly R.S. Steele, Freelance Writer(Feel free to call me Kelly, Arcane, or Arc)</b><br /> The world is not beautiful, therefore it is.-Keiichi Sigsawa, Kino's Journey<br /> Feminine pronouns, please.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","name":"ArcaneArts","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar99_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11384"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-20T19:03:07-08:00","id":76033,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>ArcaneArts</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/5750-movies?p=75979#post75979\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Also, am I <i>supposed</i> to take comic book Drax seriously?</div> </div> </div> </div>In the first Annihilus War...lets say it with pics; Drax's fight with Lunatik: <a href=\"http://static.comicvine.com/uploads/original/12/127830/2488133-drax_04_010.jpg\" target=\"_blank\">First panel</a>. and here's the <a href=\"http://static.comicvine.com/uploads/original/1/15047/1078737-drax_the_destroyer_04__of_04___2006___minutemen_rainsdesire_.cbr___page_11.jpg\" target=\"_blank\">2nd panel</a><br /> <br /> Considering how much of a joke they portray wolverine in the movies, as compared to the comic-books, I'm kind of certain that many will take a hyper version just as seriously.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>Mankind was once an endangered species. It will likely be so again. And mankind will only have itself to blame.</i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/144-shadowflame","name":"Shadowflame","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar144_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1223"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-20T21:35:42-08:00","id":76092,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Shadowflame</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/5750-movies?p=76033#post76033\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> In the first Annihilus War...lets say it with pics; Drax's fight with Lunatik: <a href=\"http://static.comicvine.com/uploads/original/12/127830/2488133-drax_04_010.jpg\" target=\"_blank\">First panel</a>. and here's the <a href=\"http://static.comicvine.com/uploads/original/1/15047/1078737-drax_the_destroyer_04__of_04___2006___minutemen_rainsdesire_.cbr___page_11.jpg\" target=\"_blank\">2nd panel</a><br /> <br /> Considering how much of a joke they portray wolverine in the movies, as compared to the comic-books, I'm kind of certain that many will take a hyper version just as seriously.</div> </div> </div> </div>I see.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://static.comicvine.com/uploads/original/1/15047/1078737-drax_the_destroyer_04__of_04___2006___minutemen_rainsdesire_.cbr___page_11.jpg\" target=\"_blank\">One</a> of <a href=\"http://static.comicvine.com/uploads/original/12/127830/2488133-drax_04_010.jpg\" target=\"_blank\">these</a> is not <a href=\"http://i1.ytimg.com/vi/rnAtqUp8y0g/0.jpg\" target=\"_blank\">like</a> the <a href=\"http://www.writeups.org/img/fiche/4545b.jpg\" target=\"_blank\">other</a>.<br /> <br /> Just saying.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Kelly R.S. Steele, Freelance Writer(Feel free to call me Kelly, Arcane, or Arc)</b><br /> The world is not beautiful, therefore it is.-Keiichi Sigsawa, Kino's Journey<br /> Feminine pronouns, please.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","name":"ArcaneArts","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar99_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11384"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-21T04:41:16-08:00","id":76184,"title":"","content":"Granted Drax for a large chunk of his history was also like this...<br /> <img src=\"http://4.bp.blogspot.com/-gxR3WmMbKQY/UiArIA27jpI/AAAAAAAAAHE/XoUEGjQwbG8/s1600/1492301-drax_the_destroyer.jpg\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/><br /> He also was a big fan of Alf....<br /> <br /> I have a feeling that the Guardians movie will be more along the lines of the 2008 series, can have serious moments as well as comedic ones. Closest thing to it is Farscape which could handle both extremes very well. Also the people doing this movie are very different then the people who did the X-Men series.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":363,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/363-muscadomestica","user":"MuscaDomestica","date":". 02-21-2014, 08:25 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/363-muscadomestica","name":"MuscaDomestica","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar363_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"189"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-21T05:56:43-08:00","id":76217,"title":"","content":"<br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>ArcaneArts</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/5750-movies?p=76092#post76092\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I see.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://static.comicvine.com/uploads/original/1/15047/1078737-drax_the_destroyer_04__of_04___2006___minutemen_rainsdesire_.cbr___page_11.jpg\" target=\"_blank\">One</a> of <a href=\"http://static.comicvine.com/uploads/original/12/127830/2488133-drax_04_010.jpg\" target=\"_blank\">these</a> is not <a href=\"http://i1.ytimg.com/vi/rnAtqUp8y0g/0.jpg\" target=\"_blank\">like</a> the <a href=\"http://www.writeups.org/img/fiche/4545b.jpg\" target=\"_blank\">other</a>.<br /> <br /> Just saying.</div> </div> </div> </div>That was my point. They went from cosmic crusader (his one man crusade against Thanos) to some ersatz super Wolverine, and that's the more generous statement, as from I'm seeing so far, (which isn't much I admit) this version of him is all about big guns. They skipped loads of history. When Thanos was reportedly dead, his sole purpose, the very reason he was recreated was taken from him and he went all childlike for a long time.<br /> <br /> Bear in mind, I've already stated that this will likely be a fun movie. But if they want to connect it to some of the more serious work done in comic-books, then <i>from what I see now</i> it'll be a massive failure akin to the 3rd X-Men movie. If they want to connect this to Thanos...and they should, then they need to bring in the one person that has ever been able to out-think him; Warlock.<br /> <br /> Too much unknowns to make a complete judgment I admit that.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>Mankind was once an endangered species. It will likely be so again. And mankind will only have itself to blame.</i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/144-shadowflame","name":"Shadowflame","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar144_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1223"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-21T07:00:04-08:00","id":76253,"title":"","content":"BTW, the comedic tone of the Guardians movie may come from director James Gunn. He's done great darkly comedic(sort of) superhero movies. The Specials and Super. If you haven't seen them, I highly recommend them.<br /> <br /> I have faith that he'll make a great movie. It'll be different in tone from some of the previous Marvel movies, but I think it'll be great. And maybe the whole as a whole won't be as comedic as this first trailer shows...","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://mrgone.rocksolidshells.com/\" target=\"_blank\">MrGone's Character Sheets</a><br /> For all your WoD Character Sheet Needs<br /> _________________________________<br /> Buy books &amp; pdfs from DTRPG and support my web site! <a href=\"http://www.drivethrurpg.com/browse.php?affiliate_id=55414\" target=\"_blank\">Click Here</a><br /> Support my site on Patreon! <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/mrgone\" target=\"_blank\">Click Here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24-mr-gone","name":"Mr Gone","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2695"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-22T11:13:16-08:00","id":77210,"title":"","content":"<b><u>Pompeii</u></b><br /> <br /> Well...it is what it is...I think I'd like to see more of Ms. Browning.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>Mankind was once an endangered species. It will likely be so again. And mankind will only have itself to blame.</i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/144-shadowflame","name":"Shadowflame","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar144_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1223"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-22T17:27:39-08:00","id":77419,"title":"","content":"THe Lego Movie is one of the most intelligent films to have come out recently and everyone needs to see it.<br /> <br /> I mean it.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Kelly R.S. Steele, Freelance Writer(Feel free to call me Kelly, Arcane, or Arc)</b><br /> The world is not beautiful, therefore it is.-Keiichi Sigsawa, Kino's Journey<br /> Feminine pronouns, please.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","name":"ArcaneArts","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar99_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","