 class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>ArcaneArts</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/5750-movies?p=77846#post77846\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"> A lot of the time, you seem like you just want to piss people off. Quite frankly, if you had just said the last paragraph of this <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/5750-movies?p=77623#post77623\">part</a> and kept out Dumbass America and some of the other shit, I wouldn't care. Instead, You come across as pretentious as the artsy-fartsy critics you seem to disdain, and cruder to boot.</div> </div> </div> </div>Lying down and letting people walk all over you when they aren't kicking you might be your thing, but it has never been mine. I gave my reasons why I didn't like the movie as much as others, and someone insults me because my post wasn't in agreement. And you imagine I'm crude? What response would this merit? (Yes, you can think &quot;crude&quot; at this point.) <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>ArcaneArts</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/5750-movies?p=77846#post77846\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I mean, it's not like you have to like everything everyone else does-I know I hate 300 and a lot of people here like it-but I've never had any issue over it because I just talk about the movie.</div> </div> </div> </div>*shrugs* I don't think 300 is for everyone. I'll look at the sequel, but my expectations are a bit low.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>Mankind was once an endangered species. It will likely be so again. And mankind will only have itself to blame.</i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/144-shadowflame","name":"Shadowflame","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar144_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1223"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-23T20:04:26-08:00","id":78009,"title":"","content":"<span style=\"color:#FF0000\"><b>Enough. Let it go.</b></span>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>I game. This is the way.</b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8-storyteller","name":"Storyteller","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"428"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-24T10:31:51-08:00","id":78415,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>JimB</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/5750-movies?p=77699#post77699\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I would like to discuss <b>the Lego Movie</b>, but I can't think of any meaningful way to do so without spoiling the plot.</div> </div> </div> </div><a href=\"http://www.youtube.com/watch