r /> Support my site on Patreon! <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/mrgone\" target=\"_blank\">Click Here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24-mr-gone","name":"Mr Gone","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2695"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-24T13:36:30-08:00","id":78545,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Mr Gone</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/5750-movies?p=78487#post78487\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I'm fine with it. I liked what they did with the Mandarin, and I'm looking forward to that marvel one-shot short about him...</div> </div> </div> </div>They could have done it without using him. One of if not the most iconic Iron Man character didn't need to be done that way. Using him had zero actual meaning except to fans and then his use was totally meaningless. If they just used random Character Y wouldn't have changed anything about the plot.<br /> <br /> And the funny is they just run right past A.I.M which should have made a bigger point. It was like the GI Joe movie or Spider-Man 3. If we throw enough names at you it could be cool. Don't get me wrong though I really enjoyed Iron Man 3, but it was so pointless.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Forever and always forward.<br /> Don't ask why that came to mind or that I felt the need to post it.<br /> I see the incorporeally challenged.","edited":{"userid":0,"u