 All in all, good work.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>- If you must be ridiculous, I must ridicule you.<br /> - Those that can give up essential liberties in exchange for temporary safety deserve neither liberty nor safety. -- Benjamin Franklin</i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/375-papa-bear","name":"Papa Bear","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar375_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1920"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-24T14:27:00-08:00","id":78606,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Storyteller</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/5750-movies?p=78585#post78585\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><b>On a related note, IMPORTANT!</b><br /> Sorry for yelling. A good friend of mine watched the new Captain America 2 trailer, and warned us there is a major spoiler in it. Then a mutual friend of ours responded that there is also a major plot spoiler in the song titles of the movie soundtrack. If you plan to see that film, you may want to avoid those spoilers if possible.</div> </div> </div> </div>Thanks. Good to know. That was something I hated when T2 came out. The start of the movie was totally designed to surprise you that he was actually a good guy this time. Every press/talk show/etc the actors/director did they told you he was good this time. Major plot point ruined by the company themselves.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Forever and always