 a movie, a pleasant surprise. Decent script with actors in roles they were comfortable with. Not a big wow factor here, but a very watchable movie. As a project I suspect this can be considered a fair success.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>Mankind was once an endangered species. It will likely be so again. And mankind will only have itself to blame.</i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/144-shadowflame","name":"Shadowflame","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar144_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1223"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-03-23T23:43:16-07:00","id":97325,"title":"","content":"My first new movie this weekend were <b>Astro-Zombies M3: Cloned</b>. Yeah, it was awful, but a wife of one of the guys at work was in it so I decided to check it out. They told me up front it was awful, so I was amused by its bad B movie awfulness. I don't recommend this film at all, unless you are looking for something to make you laugh while drinking.<br /> <br /> I also watched <b>Cockneys vs Zombies</b>. Decent film that entertained me and made me laugh. This one is worth checking out if you enjoy Brit humor and zombie flicks.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>I game. This is the way.</b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8-storyteller","name":"Storyteller","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"428"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-03-30T10:40:39-07:00","id":102024,"title":"","content":"HOW COME NO ONE MENTIONED THIS MOVIE!?<br /> <br /> <div class=\"b-bb