hankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-03T07:31:25-07:00","id":124477,"title":"","content":"Yeah and he followed that video up with one explaining <a href=\"http://www.escapistmagazine.com/videos/view/escape-to-the-movies/9143-You-Are-Wrong-About-Spider-Man-3?utm_source=latest&amp;utm_medium=index_carousel&amp;utm_campaign=all\" target=\"_blank\">how Spider-man 3 is actually better than Amazing Spider-man 2</a>. <br /> <br /> Honestly I'd only see Amazing Spider-man 2 if I decide to rent it down the road. After the abomination of the first film this one appeals far less to me and after seeing reviews from people I trust, like MovieBob, I'm staying away from this.<br /> <br /> I kind of wish it does poorly to that Sony puts a stop on this now rather than suffer through more films like they've got planned. But let's face it unless it bombs Sony isn't going to let the license expire and go back to Marvel.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://youtu.be/_yBS2EZFduI?t=2m13s\" target=\"_blank\">Homo sapiens. What an inventive, invincible species. It's only a few million years since they crawled up out of the mud and learned to walk. Puny, defenceless bipeds. They've survived flood, famine and plague. They've survived cosmic wars and holocausts. And now, here they are, out among the stars, waiting to begin a new life. Ready to outsit eternity. They're indomitable. Indomitable.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/420-akatsukileader13","name":"AkatsukiLeader13","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar420_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1637"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-03T08:58:37-07:00","id":124534,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>AkatsukiLeader13</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/5750-movies?p=124477#post124477\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Yeah and he followed that video up with one explaining <a href=\"http://www.escapistmagazine.com/videos/view/escape-to-the-movies/9143-You-Are-Wrong-About-Spider-Man-3?utm_source=latest&amp;utm_medium=index_carousel&amp;utm_campaign=all\" target=\"_blank\">how Spider-man 3 is actually better than Amazing Spider-man 2</a>.<br /> <br /> Honestly I'd only see Amazing Spider-man 2 if I decide to rent it down the road. After the abomination of the first film this one appeals far less to me and after seeing reviews from people I trust, like MovieBob, I'm staying away from this.<br /> <br /> I kind of wish it does poorly to that Sony puts a stop on this now rather than suffer through more films like they've got planned. But let's face it unless it bombs Sony isn't going to let the license expire and go back to Marvel.</div> </div> </div> </div>oh don't worry, if it does poorly they'll just reboot the movie series and tell the origin again.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Odd_Canuck is not a topical medication or food product and is not to be taken internally or seriously.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/31-odd_canuck","name":"Odd_Canuck","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar31_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1474"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-03T09:17:13-07:00","id":124