te:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2293"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-08-03T16:20:49-07:00","id":217630,"title":"","content":"Just got back from Guardians of the Galaxy.<br /> <br /> Next time I'm playing a game, I'm either playing an elemental or a talking anthropomorphic animal.<br /> <br /> If this is any indicator of the quality of space opera adventure movies Disney can produce, I think Star Wars VII just might have a chance. /thumbs up/","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I'm feeling bluuuueeeee~","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/175-prometheus878","name":"Prometheus878","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar175_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1477"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-08-03T19:39:51-07:00","id":217815,"title":"","content":"Just came back from seeing GotG for the second time. Loved it just as much as the first time. If someone would've told me that Marvel could take this property(arguably with C-list characters) and make it into a Summer blockbuster, I would've punched them in the face.<br /> <br /> While a bit rushed, the story, the characters, the special effects, the music, etc. were all fantastic. Just a fun, FUN movie. Marvel is kicking ass.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">&quot;Steel isn't strong, boy. Flesh is stronger.&quot;</span></span></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/95-fat-larry","name":"Fat Larry","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar95_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1337"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-08-03T20:34:42-07:00","id":217843,"title":"","content":"As I posted elsewhere, This fluffy Disney Cinematic Universe doesn't seem to have superheroes that are...well, super, unless it's tech-oriented. and the Nova Force is derived from the World Mind, so that doesn't really fit in. Most of the heroes are pretty much &quot;human-level;&quot; the capability of most of the characters are no more or less than that. It's annoying. I expected dozen of Nova corpsmen zooming through those enemy ships, and tearing into that Kree warship. No, instead we have a bunch of mercs...*sigh*","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>Mankind was once an endangered species. It will likely be so again. And mankind will only have itself to blame.</i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/144-shadowflame","name":"Shadowflame","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar144_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1223"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-08-03T20:45:14-07:00","id":217850,"title":"","content":"The movie based on a book about antiheroes chose to make the antiheroes more effective than the cops so the cops don't steal the spotlight from the antihero protagonists, and to remove similarities the cops have to a certain Ryan Reynolds vehicle that shall go unnamed. Both of those choices make sense to me.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/271-jimb","name":"JimB","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar271_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"ran