 pretty much &quot;human-level;&quot; the capability of most of the characters are no more or less than that.</div> </div> </div> </div><div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">Uh, I have fairly clear memories of Drax being thrown into a stone wall hard enough to leave an impact crater and him still getting up to fight; of both Gamora and Star-Lord being exposed to the vacuum of space and not instantly dying; of Rocket building a gravity bomb out of scraps in about forty seconds; and of Groot being shattered into splinters and getting over that as a minor inconvenience with a little bed rest. I think we need to discuss what you define as &quot;human-level.&quot;</div></div> </div> </div><br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/271-jimb","name":"JimB