5); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"><img src=\"http://4.bp.blogspot.com/-VqGyX4wQ_2k/USXaklVCxyI/AAAAAAAAPEA/3wQ9qazL9cY/s1600/023.jpg\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/> And <a href=\"http://static.comicvine.com/uploads/original/1/15047/1078737-drax_the_destroyer_04__of_04___2006___minutemen_rainsdesire_.cbr___page_11.jpg\" target=\"_blank\">this follows but is too big</a></div></div> </div> </div> Ronan was just too silly. Big gun of the Kree and this is what we got. A one-note villain..totally forgettable. Almost as bad as not having one single &quot;human rocket.&quot;...And nothing in the way of characterizing the Kree...Nebula was a waste of space...An actor as awesome as Djimon Hounsou...another waste, but this one of the actor's talent....And then there's how quick everyone seemed to bond...really? A day earlier you're trying to kill me, the next I'm supposed to be willing to take a bullet for you? Doesn't work for me....need to get on another pc...this one is just awful.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>Mankind was once an endangered species. It will likely be so again. And mankind will only have itself to blame.</i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/144-shadowflame","name":"Shadowflame","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar144_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1223"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-08-04T16:09:29-07:00","id":218596,"title":"","content":"Dear Shadow-&quot;I-hate-ever