":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/144-shadowflame","name":"Shadowflame","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar144_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1223"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-08-05T06:12:19-07:00","id":218990,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Shadowflame</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/5750-movies?p=218980#post218980\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">And just what the hell have you and everyone else been doing here dog piling on top of me because of a <i>difference of opinion?</i></div> </div> </div> </div>I am not really worried about your opinions. I am annoyed with you because of your warping of the facts to suit your opinion (which you have been consistently ignoring), like saying that the Guardians all have human power levels, or saying that Ronan is boring for acting like a one-note psychopath while saying Drax sucks for <i>not</i> acting like a one-note psychopath. As for what everyone else has been doing, I cannot speak to that with any authority, but I would guess they feel like they are paying you back in kind with negativity that feels like an attack on your opinion.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":271,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/271-jimb","user":"JimB","date":".  which =/= while 08-05-2014, 09:34 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/271-jimb","name":"JimB","avatar":"https://forum.the