onyxpath.com/member/1700-blue-fox","user":"Blue Fox","date":". 08-05-2014, 05:13 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1700-blue-fox","name":"Blue Fox","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1700_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"191"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-08-05T19:34:30-07:00","id":219754,"title":"","content":"So a little late but seriously had a lot of fun with Guardians too bad Gamora was a completely new character who was in no way, shape, or form is like her badass comic book version.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/116-epimetheus","name":"Epimetheus","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1758"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-08-05T20:36:05-07:00","id":219803,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>JimB</strong> </div> <div class=\"message\">Then by that same logic, get used to me calling you out on it. I don't mind you having a different opinion (though I do get tired of how much you hate joy), but I do object fairly stridently to you making stuff up</div> </div> </div> </div> You calling me out on..what exactly? My personal opinion? <img src=\"http://images.quebles.com/hotmail/emoticons/1511767.GIF\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/> Yeah..I made stuff up..such as? Everything I saw in the movie?...LOL","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>Mankind was once an endangered species. It will likely be so again. And mankind will only have itself to blame.</i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/144-shadowflame","name":"Shadowflame","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar144_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1223"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-08-05T20:44:06-07:00","id":219808,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Shadowflame</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/5750-movies?p=219803#post219803\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"> You calling me out on...what exactly? My personal opinion?</div> </div> </div> </div>I have already explained that I object to you creating untrue statements and billing them as facts. I have listed the ones I object to in my various posts, and I have even underlined one of them by repeating it; specifically, your provably false assertion that the Guardians are &quot;no more than human&quot; in terms of power. If you do not yet know what I am talking about, then I think you must be deliberately bending your efforts toward not understanding, and I do not see a particular profit to be had continually repeating myself to someone under those conditions.<br /> <br /> If you would like to discuss where I think you have erred, then I will require a show of good faith from you and ask that you read the last few pages yourself for where I think your facts are falsified. If, on the other hand, you want to just keep dismissing me while posting emojis, feel free to do so. I assure you I will cry myself to sleep at night at the humiliation of you having found a yellow circle that seems to be laughing.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":271,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/271-jimb","user":"JimB","date":". 08-05-2014, 11:46 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/271-jimb","name":"JimB","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar271_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2293"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-08-06T07:06:31-07:00","id":220124,"title":"","content":"Shadowflame, the main problem here, it seems to me, is that <i>you have already decided that you dislike the MCU</i>, and you're just coming up with reasons to justify that. Your constant snark about &quot;Disney fluff&quot; just calls attention to it. That was you going on awhile back about how all the &quot;alien tech&quot; in the Thor movies was Disney's fault, despite people repeatedly pointing out that that was completely faithful to the comics Stan and Jack had made back in the 60s, wasn't it? <br /> <br /> What, specifically, is it about Disney that you hate so much?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/681-hand-of-omega","name":"Hand-of-Omega","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar681_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2747"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-08-06T07:14:04-07:00","id":220131,"title":"","content":"&lt;&lt;in his best Bones impersonation&gt;&gt; Dammit, Jim, this is an online forum, not a real one.<br /> <br /> Block his ass and move on, people are allowed to be wrong on the internet.......<a href=\"http://xkcd.com/386/\" target=\"_blank\">or are they?</a>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>- If you must be ridiculous, I must ridicule you.<br /> - Those that can give up essential liberties in exchange for temporary safety deserve neither liberty nor safety. -- Benjamin Franklin</i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/375-papa-bear","name":"Papa Bear","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar375_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1920"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-08-06T07:22:32-07:00","id":220160,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Papa Bear</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/5750-movies?p=220131#post220131\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Block his ass and move on, people are allowed to be wrong on the internet.</div> </div> </div> </div>They are allowed to be, by all means. However, I think it diminishes everyone when provable falsehoods are allowed to pass unchallenged. Some poor, innocent soul out there will be suckered into believing it. As a concession to my own sanity, I won't go out hunting for these things (which is why I have not bothered to click the link Shadowflame provided), but if they come in front of my face, I'll say something.<br /> <br /> If people would like, though, I will spoiler tag them so you don't have to read them.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/271-jimb","name":"JimB","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar271_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2293"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-08-06T07:24:41-07:00","id":220162,"title":"","content":"Eh, it's not that &quot;he's wrong&quot;, per se...some of his points people even agree with. It's just that he seems to have such a transparently blatant bias against things that aren't even the movies fault, like the company that made it, that's worth bringing up. But yeah, if he doesn't want to respond, moving on...<br /> <br /> (Except to point out that Groot *impaling* a dozen soldiers, then smashing a dozen OTHER soldiers with their bodies, was pretty superhuman...and damned hardcore!)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/681-hand-of-omega","name":"Hand-of-Omega","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar681_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2747"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-08-06T09:13:06-07:00","id":220281,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>JimB</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/5750-movies?p=220160#post220160\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">If people would like, though, I will spoiler tag them so you don't have to read them.</div> </div> </div> </div>It's not about us, it's about you not getting worked up over it for no reason. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/tongue.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Stick Out Tongue\" smilieid=\"5\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> <br /> ANYYYYWAYYYYY, I should probably stay out of this topic as I haven't been to a theatre for a movie since last X-mas for Hobbit part 2 and before that it was the X-mas before that for Hobbit Part 1........yeah, I don't get to see a lot of movies until they're out on DVD.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>- If you must be ridiculous, I must ridicule you.<br /> - Those that can give up essential liberties in exchange for temporary safety deserve neither liberty nor safety. -- Benjamin Franklin</i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/375-papa-bear","name":"Papa Bear","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar375_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1920"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-08-06T09:54:39-07:00","id":220300,"title":"","content":"...<i>haven't been to a theatre for a movie since last X-mas..</i><br /> <br /> WHERE'S THE &quot;DISLIKE&quot; BUTTON?<br /> <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>Mankind was once an endangered species. It will likely be so again. And mankind will only have itself to blame.</i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/144-shadowflame","name":"Shadowflame","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar144_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1223"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-08-06T10:07:42-07:00","id":2203