=\"_blank\">Click Here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24-mr-gone","name":"Mr Gone","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2695"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-08-24T20:32:41-07:00","id":239844,"title":"","content":"Planning on seeing the new Sin City tomorrow...maybe I'll use my golden ticket to see Hercules or something else I wouldn't normally bother seeing in the theater. Or I could save it for the Avengers...even if it can't be used for openings, I'm not so hot on seeing everything ASAP anymore...","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/681-hand-of-omega","name":"Hand-of-Omega","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar681_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2747"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-08-31T15:54:21-07:00","id":245685,"title":"","content":"Today we saw 'As Above, So Below'. I liked it. It was found footage, but what can you do? <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" /> It was pretty good though. It's about a lady, who is the subject of a documentary, going into the Paris catacombs in search of the Philosopher's stone. It was pretty good, we enjoyed it. Had a few jump scares, but honestly wasn't really scary. We were kind of surprised where it all went. So, we liked it! If you don't mind found footage flicks, check it out. <br /> <br /> If nothing else, people could mine it for story ideas. <img src=\"https://forum