s/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2695"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-10-16T05:35:38-07:00","id":283754,"title":"","content":"I got to go to an advanced screen of the movie John Wick last night! I really liked it a lot! It was a great actiony revenge flick! Keanu was pretty bad ass in it too!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://mrgone.rocksolidshells.com/\" target=\"_blank\">MrGone's Character Sheets</a><br /> For all your WoD Character Sheet Needs<br /> _________________________________<br /> Buy books &amp; pdfs from DTRPG and support my web site! <a href=\"http://www.drivethrurpg.com/browse.php?affiliate_id=55414\" target=\"_blank\">Click Here</a><br /> Support my site on Patreon! <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/mrgone\" target=\"_blank\">Click Here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24-mr-gone","name":"Mr Gone","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2695"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-10-16T06:22:26-07:00","id":283783,"title":"","content":"The first commercial I saw for that movie, I came in on the middle of. It was the shot of Keanu on his knees and elbows, scraping along the floor with his face completely obscured so I couldn't see who he was. Even though I couldn't see his face, though, my first thought was, &quot;Wow, there's something really...Keanu-ish about the way that dude moves.&quot;<br /> <br /> I had no idea Keanu Reeves's movements were so identifiable.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/271-jimb","name":"JimB","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar271_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2293"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-10-16T06:23:29-07:00","id":283784,"title":"","content":"I get movies way late, Japan is way down on the list of when movies open, even Godzilla opened a lot later here than everywhere else (though it made lots of money here).<br /> <br /> I'm waiting for Equalizer on the 25th, won't have money for it until the 31st, but oh well.<br /> <br /> I will suggest the Ruruoni Kenshin live actions to anybody that gets a chance though. Granted my Japanese is limited, but it still did a very good job of capturing what I remembered from the first time I saw Ruruoni Kenshin. Three movies:<br /> <br /> Ruruoni Kenshin, which is the first major storyline, the one with the slasher with the funky eyes whose name escapes me right now.<br /> <br /> RK Kyoto Fire, which is the first half of the Shishi-o arc.<br /> <br /> RK Densetsu, which is the second half of the Shishi-o arc.<br /> <br /> There are some compressions to the storyline going on, of course, and the Ten-Swords aren't given much of a spotlight, unfortunately (the flyer and the giant are pretty much removed), but still awesome job.<br /> <br /> Aoishi, Misao, Kenshin, Sanosuke, Saitoh, Megumi....they're all there.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3961-thrythlind","name":"Thrythlind","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"214"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-10-16T08:50:13-07:00","id":283891,"title":"","content":"Jin-e.<br /> <br /> I think the first movie is fun for people familiar with the series, not necessarily for peopl