 love everything about what Marvel has been and will be doing over the next few years. They are seriously pleasing me so much it's ridiculous.<br /> <br /> A few things:<br /> <br /> 1. Black Panther. Wow. One of my all-time favorite Marvel heroes is coming to film and I'm completely confident in Marvel Studios' ability to make it amazing. The casting of T'Challa is icing on the cake.<br /> <br /> 2. I love Thor's face after he sees Captain America make the hammer move a bit. Captain America is a badass.<br /> <br /> 3. Ultron and the &quot;no strings attached&quot; bit. Perfection. I love the way Marvel gave him eyebrows. Adds to the menacing nature of the character.<br /> <br /> 4. Captain Marvel? The Inhumans? Anyone out there still think Marvel isn't taking chances? They are knocking it out of the park.While, DC has yet to get out of the infield, IMO.<br /> <br /> Only thing I'm sad about? The costs associated with any of these properties are about to skyrocket.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">&quot;Steel isn't strong, boy. Flesh is stronger.&quot;</span></span></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/95-fat-larry","name":"Fat Larry","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar95_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1337"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-10-29T13:56:22-07:00","id":296116,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Shadowflame</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/g