;. Didn't bother to even watch &quot;Catching Fire&quot;.<br /> <br /> Oh and I think Jennifer Lawrence to be terribly overrated!<br /> <br /> Now you can dip me in gas and set the fire on <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2435-prophet","name":"Prophet","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2435_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"329"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-24T10:08:48-08:00","id":320863,"title":"","content":"Catching Fire was one of the best movies of the year...that most people actually watched.<br /> The first movie of Hunger Games provoked my curiosity about the characters.<br /> Battle Royale...*yawn..&quot;So what's for dinner?&quot;<br /> After that 2nd movie to Hunger Games, there wasn't much left for comparison to &quot;Battle Royal&quot; unless anyone wants to compare that wretched sequel that they made for it.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>Mankind was once an endangered species. It will likely be so again. And mankind will only have itself to blame.</i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/144-shadowflame","name":"Shadowflame","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar144_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1223"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-24T12:16:26-08:00","id":320987,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote