th-aspect-ratio videocontainer-horizontal\" style=\"aspect-ratio: 16/9;\"> <a class=\"video-frame\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=OMOVFvcNfvE\" data-code=\"OMOVFvcNfvE\" data-provider=\"youtube\" data-height=\"0\" data-width=\"0\" itemprop=\"video\"> <div class=\"videothumbnail\" style=\"\"> <img src=\"https://img.youtube.com/vi/OMOVFvcNfvE/maxresdefault.jpg\" alt=\"\" /> <div class=\"videothumbnailoverlay\"></div> </div> </a> </div><br /> <br /> Alright, we know that:<br /> <br /> 1. The special effects are going to be <i>great</i>.<br /> <br /> 2. They're taking a chance and experimenting a bit with the designs (check out the droid in the trailer - I like it)<br /> <br /> 3. Cast diversity! (The first dude we see is a black man, and the next person is a young woman)<br /> <br /> 4. Canon awareness (Take a look at the Millennium Falcon - notice anything different that might of been because of Return of the Jedi? <img src=\"http://theonyxpath.com/forum/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/>)<br /> <br /> Possibility: restoring the Force to its previous mystique? (The voiceover dude talks about the Force in a manner that suggests magic to me)<br /> <br /> Current Mood: Cautious Optimism!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I'm feeling bluuuueeeee~","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/175-prometheus878","name":"Prometheus878","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar175_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1477"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-11-30T07:26:56-08:00","id":326001,"title":"","content":"Yea, I'm pretty excited about it. I love the look of that new lightsaber, the way th