ions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24-mr-gone","name":"Mr Gone","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2695"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-17T11:29:16-07:00","id":483765,"title":"","content":"I just saw the Batman v Superman tailer. The music they chose for it was awesome. Really stirring. Kind of got that hyped up feeling. Then they started showing scenes and the duck, I mean Ben Affleck, started talking.....<br /> <br /> Did I mention that the music they chose was awesome?<br /> <br /> I reached a new low of meh on this one. Neither him nor Henry Cavill(even after/in spite of Man of Steel) really give me that sense of the character. I mean as much as I hated the movie and thought he made the worst Clark Kent ever I still got that Superman vibe from Brandon Routh. I'm still going to pass on Dare Devil vs the Alien from some other planet.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=PWcimiuIGxM\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/google-material/image_placeholder.svg\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=PWcimiuIGxM\" target=\"_blank\"> </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=PWcimiuIGxM\" target=\"_blank\"> https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=PWcimiuIGxM </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> </div> </div> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Forever and always forward.<br /> Don't ask why that came to mind or that I felt the need to post it.<br /> I see the incorporeally challenged.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","coun