a(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\"> All of the Infinity Gems are immensely powerful, but I believe the idea was more to give Vision the powers of the Gem than to use it as fuel. WRT Thanos, the current theory is that he was planning on using Loki to create a backdoor into Asgard in order to get his hands on the Gauntlet and flush out the rest of the gems from their hiding places.</div></div> </div> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/707-etherial","name":"etherial","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar707_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"822"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-05-03T20:27:48-07:00","id":502438,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Shadowflame</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/5750-movies?p=502380#post502380\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); -moz-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75); box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50, 0.75);\"> <div style=\"display: none;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8); padding: 6px; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px;\">Thanos was supposed to be looking for all those gems, but gives one away to Loki?</div></div> </div> </div></div> </div> </div> </div>Loan out one, get back two. Sounds like a good deal.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/271-jimb","name":"JimB","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar271_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2293"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-05-03T20:35:48-07:00","id":502445,"title":"","content":"<br /> <br /> Managed to score a free ticket to opening day (yay)! <br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>LordOfAsh</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/5750-movies?p=491524#post491524\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Saw age of ultron yesterday and I was disappointed. I dont think its really bad but not great either, nowhere near the quality of the first one (Im a fan of most marvel movies and the daredevil series was excellent). It felt ...off and forced and surprisingly the humour fell flat in a lot of cases. Also I found the trailer to be very misleading regarding the overall tone and Ultron especially <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/frown.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Frown\" smilieid=\"11\" class=\"inlineimg\" /></div> </div> </div> </div>Honestly, I felt the same way until about the middle of the film...at which point, I realized that my excitement and anticipation were really raising the bar into unreachable levels for any movie to reach. Once I realized this, just relaxed and calmed down to normal levels, I found that I was able to enjoy the movie MUCH more! <br /> <br /> It's really an exquisite blend of incredibly well-shot action and quiet drama, lots of pathos balanced with tons of humor. Perfect? Of course not, I'm sure there are plot holes I haven't noticed yet, and the pacing felt a bit off in places. Actually, what bugged me most was how certain things were kinda skipped over. We film geeks are always criticizing Hollywood for treating audiences like idiots by explaining every little thing, but here the *lack* of exposition of some things stood out to me. For ex, I really felt like there was a scene missing that would have shown Black Widow getting her electric weapons (which I guess are supposed to be her Widow's Bite from the comics); suddenly, she just has them later in the movie, with no set up. <br /> <br /> Reading that there will be a longer cut makes things like this make sense, however. <br /> <br /> Ultron was NOT the baddie I remember from the comic. But James Spader couldn't have played that guy, anyway. While initially upset that Ant-Man was removed as Ultron's creator, having him based on Tony Stark actually makes *much* more sense for this version of the character and Spader's performance. As a fan of The Blacklist, I was afraid I was going to be really distracted by That Voice, but I wasn't, even though some of the mannerisms were even the same. Don't know if I like him better than Loki, tho...<br /> <br /> I'll probably have to see it again before I can really determine where it stands next to Avengers, Winter Soldier and Guardians of the Galaxy, but I certainly didn't think it was *worse* than any of those! It's frankly scary how well Disney/Marvel are doing, and I'm getting increasingly afraid that when they bomb, as they inevitably must, that they're going to bomb HARD...","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/681-hand-of-omega","name":"Hand-of-Omega","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar681_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2747"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-05-03T20:40:43-07:00","id":502448,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Mr Gone</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/5750-movies?p=492970#post492970\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I saw the movie Ex Machina today. I thought it was really good! It took it's time and asked some great questions about the nature of A.I. and how it should be treated once created...</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> I actually heard that that's a good companion piece for AoU's themes, in some ways!<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Dude of Legend</strong> </div> <div class=\"message\">Oh, and stay for the credits!</div> </div> </div> </div>Um, why? I hope it's not a spoiler to point out that there's nothing after them...<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>JimB</strong> </div> <div class=\"message\"> The best line in <b>Avengers: Age of Ultron</b> is, &quot;Oh, for God's sake!&quot;</div> </div> </div> </div>I'll see that line and raise you, &quot;You know, with the benefit of hindsight--&quot;<img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/681-hand-of-omega","name":"Hand-of-Omega","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar681_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2747"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-05-04T05:47:08-07:00","id":502806,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>etherial</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/5750-movies?p=502397#post502397\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"messa