nd putting her down, the others clearly don't care, and the would-be producer just wants to get her in the sack. So what you get is sort of a mirror. On one hand, the agents want to exploit her and the producer wants to use her, and the cult wants her to give in, on the other hand the friends want her to exploit her and use her and have her give in and try to be like them. There is a standout, in the roommate, who does honestly seem to care about her. And obviously the movie side has a more sinister bent, but it would lead to great success.<br /> <br /> The movie is all about that, the price of fame and fortune and the cost it can take from you and whether you want it enough that the cost is worth it.</div></div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> Great flick, really turns the standard on its head, and I appreciate pretty much any attempt to do that.</div> </div> </div> </div>I saw that a bit back ago and really liked it alot!!<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://mrgone.rocksolidshells.com/\" target=\"_blank\">MrGone's Character Sheets</a><br /> For all your WoD Character Sheet Needs<br /> _________________________________<br /> Buy books &amp; pdfs from DTRPG and support my web site! <a href=\"http://www.drivethrurpg.com/browse.php?affiliate_id=55414\" target=\"_blank\">Click Here</a><br /> Support my site on Patreon! <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/mrgone\" target=\"_blank\">Click Here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24-mr-gone","name":"Mr Gone","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2695"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-07-05T08:13:30-07:00","id":579835,"title":"","content":"I saw Terminator Genisys the other day. Not too bad. It had lots of nods to the 1st two Terminat