y <strong>nofather</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/5750-movies?p=792475#post792475\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I just got back from the movie of the year.<br /> <br /> The Hateful Eight.<br /> <br /> Seriously not for everybody. I thought Tarantino was sort of losing his touch the past couple movies, but this really hearkens back to Reservoir Dogs and Pulp Fiction and Jackie Brown. Great acting all around, really solid story. Completely fucking brutal.</div> </div> </div> </div>Fascinating. I'd heard it was two hours of angry jerkfaces being unlikeable followed by one hour of violence that wasn't worth sitting through the first two hours to get to.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/707-etherial","name":"etherial","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar707_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"822"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-12-28T07:09:37-08:00","id":794152,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>etherial</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/5750-movies?p=794139#post794139\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Fascinating. I'd heard it was two hours of angry jerkfaces being unlikeable followed by one hour of violence that wasn't worth sitting through the first two hours to get to.</div> </div> </div> </div>No, but it was about some hateful people. Thus the title.<br /> <br /> Despite the unsavory views of some of the characters, they were fleshed out enough to appreciate them as more than simple stereotypes. As it took place after a notable and vicious war and more than a few characters were veterans of said war, their animosity towards each other was understandable.<br /> <br /> I suppose if you're just sitting through a movie to get to the violent parts it would be hard to appreciate the rest of the movie, though I think even the type of person who would do that would appreciate the violent parts.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":886,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather","user":"nofather","date":". 12-28-2015, 10:18 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather","name":"nofather","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar886_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11016"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-01-19T19:46:33-08:00","id":812318,"title":"","content":"The new Suicide Squad trailer gives me hope.<br /> <br /> Robbie looks like she's bringing the madness of Harley Quinn out perfectly.<br /> <br /> Deadshot still sucks, though. Will Smith looks like he's playing Will Smith from Bad Boys and I can't get that out of my head.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">&quot;Steel isn't strong, boy. Flesh is stronger.&quot;</span></span></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/95-fat-larry","name":"Fat Larry","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar95_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"