atar681_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2747"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-03-27T08:25:21-07:00","id":854053,"title":"","content":"Finally saw <b>Hateful 8</b>! Can't believe a movie that long and sparse was that entertaining! Esp for being sooo very bleak, probably Tarantino's darkest film yet...<br /> <br /> <b>Zootopia </b>was the opposite, but equally entertaining. Surprisingly topical, with some strong themes of social criticism that I wasn't expecting, and solid character work. And I LOL at all the sight gags, one-liners and pop culture refs (esp to Frozen), so I count this as a win!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/681-hand-of-omega","name":"Hand-of-Omega","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar681_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2747"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-03-27T09:16:42-07:00","id":854076,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Mr Gone</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/5750-movies?p=847928#post847928\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I saw '10 Cloverfield Lane' on Sunday. I thought it was great! I didn't know much going in...and it kept me guessing. Theres no real connection to Cloverfield, so if you go in expecting that you might be disappointed. Aside from that, I loved everything about it.</div> </div> </div> </div>