&quot;Only the Strong Survive&quot;. You see a big blue man choking a small blue woman. Which one looks strong to you?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/707-etherial","name":"etherial","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar707_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"822"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-06-06T10:38:02-07:00","id":908428,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>garhkal</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/5750-movies?p=908144#post908144\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> I think it was more they used the pic of him choking a female lead character that got people up in a tizzy..</div> </div> </div> </div>And? Should they have been playing checkers, instead?<br /> <br /> Would it have been better if Mystique was choking Apocalypse?<br /> <br /> Apocalypse has always been one of the X-Men's deadliest foes, and his &quot;survival of the fittest&quot; mantra looked to be on perfect display on the billboard.<br /> <br /> I don't agree with why there was an uproar(on Tumblr, etc.), but I'm sadly not surprised. Not in the least.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">&quot;Steel isn't strong, boy. Flesh is stronger.&quot;</span></span></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/95-fat-larry","name":"Fat Larry","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar95_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1337"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-06-06T11:31:18-07:00","id":908461,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>etherial</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/5750-movies?p=908316#post908316\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">The billboard says &quot;Only the Strong Survive&quot;. You see a big blue man choking a small blue woman. Which one looks strong to you?</div> </div> </div> </div>My point exactly. To most every sane person i have mentioned this too, that billboard didn't seem to be glorifying violence against women in anyway shape or form.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Fat Larry</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/5750-movies?p=908428#post908428\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Apocalypse has always been one of the X-Men's deadliest foes, and his &quot;survival of the fittest&quot; mantra looked to be on perfect display on the billboard.<br /> <br /> I don't agree with why there was an uproar(on Tumblr, etc.), but I'm sadly not surprised. Not in the least.</div> </div> </div> </div>Neither am i. It seems these days especially there are just those out there who look for the slightest thing to nitpick and rant about, just to get someone to 'apologize' to them..","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11674-garhkal","name":"garhkal","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11674_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"547"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-06-08T00:23:13-07:00","id":909895,"title":"","content":"I have now seen Deadpool twice, and i hope to GOD they make some more X movies (or just superhero) ones like it.. Maybe not as vulgar, but ones where there is some GOOD comedy in them..<br /> <br /> <br /> Now, who's everyone's pick for Cable for the 2nd film??","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11674-garhkal","name":"garhkal","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11674_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"547"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-06-08T06:52:42-07:00","id":910035,"title":"","content":"I saw the remake of Roots. It was deep, emotional, and heartbreaking.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/707-etherial","name":"etherial","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar707_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"822"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-06-09T04:25:09-07:00","id":910682,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>garhkal</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/5750-movies?p=909895#post909895\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I have now seen Deadpool twice, and i hope to GOD they make some more X movies (or just superhero) ones like it.. Maybe not as vulgar, but ones where there is some GOOD comedy in them..<br /> <br /> <br /> Now, who's everyone's pick for Cable for the 2nd film??</div> </div> </div> </div>I loved Deadpool!! Very glad they did the character justice.<br /> <br /> As for Cable...heres my pick(scroll down this link for some pics): <a href=\"http://www.hypable.com/deadpool-2-cable-stephen-lang/\" target=\"_blank\">http://www.hypable.com/deadpool-2-cable-stephen-lang/</a>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://mrgone.rocksolidshells.com/\" target=\"_blank\">MrGone's Character Sheets</a><br /> For all your WoD Character Sheet Needs<br /> _________________________________<br /> Buy books &amp; pdfs from DTRPG and support my web site! <a href=\"http://www.drivethrurpg.com/browse.php?affiliate_id=55414\" target=\"_blank\">Click Here</a><br /> Support my site on Patreon! <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/mrgone\" target=\"_blank\">Click Here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24-mr-gone","name":"Mr Gone","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2695"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-06-09T11:07:02-07:00","id":910967,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Mr Gone</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/5750-movies?p=910682#post910682\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> I loved Deadpool!! Very glad they did the character justice.<br /> <br /> As for Cable...heres my pick(scroll down this link for some pics): <a href=\"http://www.hypable.com/deadpool-2-cable-stephen-lang/\" target=\"_blank\">http://www.hypable.com/deadpool-2-cable-stephen-lang/</a></div> </div> </div> </div>I've seen several recommend Steven lang elsewhere... He definitely has the looks, but imo is a little old for the role..<br /> <br /> Now onto transformers.. One of MY biggest gripes with the whole franchise so far, is that they have kept having the Same characters in damn near all the films.. Why not get some MORE of the G1 transformers, like Dirge, Skywarp, Gears, Brawl and Rumble into the mix, or start including some of the Latter G1/G2 guys like Ultra magnus, Springer (one of the triple changers), or a head master!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11674-garhkal","name":"garhkal","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11674_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"547"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-06-10T04:25:24-07:00","id":911571,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>garhkal</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/5750-movies?p=910967#post910967\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I've seen several recommend Steven lang elsewhere... He definitely has the looks, but imo is a little old for the role..</div> </div> </div> </div>Cable, in the comics(least in the 90's) always came off as old to me. Of course, I haven't followed em for years now, so I'm sure they've changed him up. But yea, I think the guy looks perfect.<br /> <br /> I've heard some mentions of Ron Pearlman(he's a good actor...but I don't know) or Jeffrey Dean Morgan. I could be down for that, he's pretty awesome.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://mrgone.rocksolidshells.com/\" target=\"_blank\">MrGone's Character Sheets</a><br /> For all your WoD Character Sheet Needs<br /> _________________________________<br /> Buy books &amp; pdfs from DTRPG and support my web site! <a href=\"http://www.drivethrurpg.com/browse.php?affiliate_id=55414\" target=\"_blank\">Click Here</a><br /> Support my site on Patreon! <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/mrgone\" target=\"_blank\">Click Here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24-mr-gone","name":"Mr Gone","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2695"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-06-10T10:48:04-07:00","id":911762,"title":"","content":"Morgan is young enough, but i am not sure he has the looks... Ron Pearlman would be good..","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11674-garhkal","name":"garhkal","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11674_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"547"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-06-14T04:26:11-07:00","id":913997,"title":"","content":"Oh, I saw Warcraft this past weekend. Much better than expected! There is actually a pretty decent story. The effects are nice and the action is pretty good. I was surprised by it.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://mrgone.rocksolidshells.com/\" target=\"_blank\">MrGone's Character Sheets</a><br /> For all your WoD Character Sheet Needs<br /> _________________________________<br /> Buy books &amp; pdfs from DTRPG and support my web site! <a href=\"http://www.drivethrurpg.com/browse.php?affiliate_id=55414\" target=\"_blank\">Click Here</a><br /> Support my site on Patreon! <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/mrgone\" target=\"_blank\">Click Here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24-mr-gone","name":"Mr Gone","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2695"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-06-15T20:15:29-07:00","id":915328,"title":"","content":"Warcraft wasn't bad. I had pretty terrible expectations and it definitely did better than I thought. They changed some of the lore around, of course, but I found that the movie remained fairly close to the original storyline, just made easier for viewers to follow. <br /> <br /> There were a few places I thought it fell apart for people who weren't familiar with the original story, (like Medivh's actions) but overall I'd say it was decent. I'd give it a 8/10 all told. It could have been better, but for a fantasy movies about orcs and humans duking it out, it was rather enjoyable.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/741-anubisxy","name":"AnubisXy","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar741_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5693"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-06-15T20:31:12-07:00","id":915336,"title":"","content":"I have to admit, I'm trusting you both more than the reviews.<br /> <br /> Are you both players of World of Warcraft? Or were you?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather","name":"nofather","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar886_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11016"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-06-17T04:20:07-07:00","id":916115,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>nofather</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/5750-movies?p=915336#post915336\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I have to admit, I'm trusting you both more than the reviews.<br /> <br /> Are you both players of World of Warcraft? Or were you?</div> </div> </div> </div>Nope...I haven't ever played any of the Warcraft games. So, it's possible that helped, as I didn't know hardly anything about the lore of the world or anything, so it was all a complete surprise.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://mrgone.rocksolidshells.com/\" target=\"_blank\">MrGone's Character Sheets</a><br /> For all your WoD Character Sheet Needs<br /> _________________________________<br /> Buy books &amp; pdfs from DTRPG and support my web site! <a href=\"http://www.drivethrurpg.com/browse.php?affiliate_id=55414\" target=\"_blank\">Click Here</a><br /> Support my site on Patreon! <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/mrgone\" target=\"_blank\">Click Here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24-mr-gone","name":"Mr Gone","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2695"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-06-19T16:46:27-07:00","id":917627,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>nofather</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/5750-movies?p=915336#post915336\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I have to admit, I'm trusting you both more than the reviews.<br /> <br /> Are you both players of World of Warcraft? Or were you?</div> </div> </div> </div>Nein mein heir.. Heck most all those MMORPGs i have never played.. Gave galaxies a try on a friends PC.. Didn't like it.<br /> The ONLY one i might play is a Stargate related one if they ever get it done..","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11674-garhkal","name":"garhkal","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11674_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"547"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-06-19T17:33:32-07:00","id":917654,"title":"","content":"I find that interesting. I don't know what it says about anything, but I'm at least surprised non-Warcraft fans would see it. I played Warcraft and eventually World of Warcraft for a while but I was never big on the lore, since it deviated between games and seemed low priority.<br /> <br /> I just saw Hail, Caesar! and really enjoyed that. <a href=\"http://www.imdb.com/title/tt5080804/\" target=\"_blank\">Hexecutioners</a> had promise but, I think, wasted it, though it still has some good scenes. <a href=\"http://www.imdb.com/title/tt3584354/?ref_=tt_rec_tt\" target=\"_blank\">Man Vs</a>. was surprisingly good all the way through, as was <a href=\"http://www.imdb.com/title/tt4149732/?ref_=tt_rec_tt\" target=\"_blank\">Crush the Skull</a>, which reminded me of an older gem, <a href=\"http://www.imdb.com/title/tt0790590/\" target=\"_blank\">Botched</a>.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather","name":"nofather","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar886_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11016"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-06-19T22:15:24-07:00","id":917799,"title":"","content":"I'm watching all of the EON Bond movies. All of them. All 24. Starting ton