the empire&quot; without agreeing on what to replace it with.</div> </div> </div> </div>Huh? What about the New Republic?<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>You need a picture altered to fit your Exalted character, or just looking for some visual inspiration? Check out the twice-reborn <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/266-photoshop-exaltification\" target=\"_blank\"> Exaltification thread</a>. And here is my <a href=\"http://danelsan.deviantart.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Deviantart page</a><br /> <br /> S\u00f8ren Kierkegaard + Kim Kardashian = <a href=\"https://twitter.com/KimKierkegaard\" target=\"_blank\">Brilliance</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/868-danelsan","name":"danelsan","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar868_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1492"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-12-24T20:51:54-08:00","id":1021801,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>danelsan</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/5750-movies?p=1021770#post1021770\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Huh? What about the New Republic?</div> </div> </div> </div>That's what they ended up instituting. That doesn't mean the entire Alliance agreed on that at the time Rogue One takes place.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Going by Willow now, or Wil for short. She/Her/Hers.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/269-charlaquin","name":"Charlaquin","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar269_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10831"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-12-24T21:21:30-08:00","id":1021811,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Charlaquin</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/5750-movies?p=1021801#post1021801\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">That's what they ended up instituting. That doesn't mean the entire Alliance agreed on that at the time Rogue One takes place.</div> </div> </div> </div>Well, is there any evidence one way or the other? I don't know much of the new expanded universe canon.<br /> <br /> EDIT: actually, nevermind, I'll look for it on my own, no reason to keep this derail going.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>You need a picture altered to fit your Exalted character, or just looking for some visual inspiration? Check out the twice-reborn <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/266-photoshop-exaltification\" target=\"_blank\"> Exaltification thread</a>. And here is my <a href=\"http://danelsan.deviantart.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Deviantart page</a><br /> <br /> S\u00f8ren Kierkegaard + Kim Kardashian = <a href=\"https://twitter.com/KimKierkegaard\" target=\"_blank\">Brilliance</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/868-danelsan","name":"danelsan","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar868_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1492"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-12-25T10:58:07-08:00","id":1022039,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Charlaquin</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/5750-movies?p=1021677#post1021677\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Yes, yes it is... This doesn't change the fact that the rebel alliance is organized around the idea of &quot;down with the empire&quot; without agreeing on what to replace it with.</div> </div> </div> </div>I don't know about the new canon, but that was never the case with the old one.<br /> <br /> The Rebel Alliance always had the clearcut goal of removing Palpatine from power and restoring the Republic. Remember that between Episode 3 (when Palpatine seizes power) and episode 4, only about 20 years had passed. In fact, much of the Republic's apperatus was still entirely functional (Palpatine didn't even officially dissolve the Galactic Senate until Episode 4). The Rebel Alliance was founded about 10 years after Episode 3. So the vast majority of the Rebellion knew exactly what they were fighting for and had the specific goal of moving the government back to before Palpatine seized control.<br /> <br /> There may have been differences between Rebel factions over some specific details, but the overall goal of &quot;turning back the clock&quot; to the time before Palpatine took over, and otherwise restoring the Republic was pretty much the shared vision of the Rebel Alliance.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":741,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/741-anubisxy","user":"AnubisXy","date":". 12-25-2016, 02:01 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/741-anubisxy","name":"AnubisXy","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar741_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5693"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-12-25T17:34:28-08:00","id":1022146,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>AnubisXy</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/5750-movies?p=1022039#post1022039\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> I don't know about the new canon, but that was never the case with the old one.<br /> <br /> The Rebel Alliance always had the clearcut goal of removing Palpatine from power and restoring the Republic. Remember that between Episode 3 (when Palpatine seizes power) and episode 4, only about 20 years had passed. In fact, much of the Republic's apperatus was still entirely functional (Palpatine didn't even officially dissolve the Galactic Senate until Episode 4). The Rebel Alliance was founded about 10 years after Episode 3. So the vast majority of the Rebellion knew exactly what they were fighting for and had the specific goal of moving the government back to before Palpatine seized control.<br /> <br /> There may have been differences between Rebel factions over some specific details, but the overall goal of &quot;turning back the clock&quot; to the time before Palpatine took over, and otherwise restoring the Republic was pretty much the shared vision of the Rebel Alliance.</div> </div> </div> </div>I wonder how much internal strife it caused over what reforms to make. The prior Republic was degenerate enough where the invasion and outright conquest of a member planet was divisive instead of unifying in protest, the mysterious and questionable creation of a clone army was conveniently ignored, and one individual could openly seize absolute power without opposition.<br /> <br /> If the New Republic allowed the Imperial Remnants i.e. the First Order to exist and gather power with only a poorly funded resistance to keep it in check, that says disturbing things about how much corruption and indolence the new senate inherited from the old government.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I'm feeling bluuuueeeee~","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/175-prometheus878","name":"Prometheus878","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar175_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1477"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-12-25T17:41:18-08:00","id":1022150,"title":"","content":"Apparently a lot of the Republic senators were given heavy donations by the First Order, so that they would look the other way or denounce Leia's outcry over it.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather","name":"nofather","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar886_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11016"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-12-26T17:29:03-08:00","id":1022543,"title":"","conte