><br /> Support my site on Patreon! <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/mrgone\" target=\"_blank\">Click Here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24-mr-gone","name":"Mr Gone","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2695"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-10-19T15:25:06-07:00","id":1151129,"title":"","content":"It finally arrived to my country today. I was there. By the end, I was almost crying for how happy I was. It was a triumph, an adaptation done with both love for the source material and enough mastery over the genre to change it in a meaningful and effective way.<br /> <br /> I love horror, Stephen King and kids in horror. Watching this movie, knowing that it was so deservedly successfull and loved by the public just made me feel great. It's a tricky moment when the things you love gain mainstream attention. It's a risk that does not always pay offs and has plenty of pitfalls. This time, it was just perfect.<br /> <br /> I have been smiling for the last thirty minutes, coming back from the theatre, and it seems I'll keep doing it for a while","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/815620-cinder-s-comprehensive-collection-of-creations\" target=\"_blank\">Cinder's Comprehensive Collection of Creations</a> - Homebrew Hub<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/1172470-cinder-writes-about-beast-the-primordial\" target=\"_blank\">I write about Beast: The Primordial a lot</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"http