42:27-07:00","id":1304674,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Mr Gone</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/5750-movies?p=1304650#post1304650\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"https://giphy.com/gifs/thats-bait-srTYyZ1BjBtGU\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/google-material/image_placeholder.svg\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://giphy.com/gifs/thats-bait-srTYyZ1BjBtGU\" target=\"_blank\"> </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://giphy.com/gifs/thats-bait-srTYyZ1BjBtGU\" target=\"_blank\"> https://giphy.com/gifs/thats-bait-srTYyZ1BjBtGU </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> </div> </div> </div></div> </div> </div> </div><br /> lol. No bait at all. I honestly hated Last Jedi.<br /> <br /> Things like Kylo's helmet, Rey's lightsaber, Leia(which Kennedy said would NEVER return), all filled me with joy. I feel as if Abrams is telling fans 'don't worry, this franchise is in safe hands, now'. I'm not going to shit on anyone for liking TLJ. But I have it neck and neck with Ep. 1 in terms of how bad it was. <br /> <br /> This trailer gives me hope.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">&quot;Steel isn't strong, boy. Flesh is stronger.&quot;</span></span></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/95-fat-larry","name":"Fat Larry","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar95_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1337"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-04-13T13:08:32-07:00","id":1304680,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Fat Larry</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/5750-movies?p=1304674#post1304674\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I feel as if Abrams is telling fans 'don't worry, this franchise is in safe hands, now'.</div> </div> </div> </div>Jury's out on that. Them bringing back Palpatine in some form already gives me pause on indulging in more Mystery Box-ing for the sake of it.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4418-tasti-man-lh","name":"tasti man LH","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4418_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1850"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-04-13T13:16:29-07:00","id":1304684,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Fat Larry</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/5750-movies?p=1304674#post1304674\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">lol. No bait at all. I honestly hated Last Jedi.<br /> <br /> Things like Kylo's helmet, Rey's lightsaber, Leia(which Kennedy said would NEVER return), all filled me with joy. I feel as if Abrams is telling fans 'don't worry, this franchise is in safe hands, now'. I'm not going to shit on anyone for liking TLJ. But I have it neck and neck with Ep. 1 in terms of how bad it was.<br /> <br /> This trailer gives me hope.</div> </div> </div> </div>You understand that J.J Abrams was a producer on The Last Jedi and was perfectly fine with the movie that Rian Johnson and Disney made? Right? I mean, it's not like Disney let Rian Johnson make the movie in a vacuum and then just had to deal with the end result. That's not how billion dollar companies make movies. If they didn't like the movie, they wouldn't have released it. Look at Rogue One and Solo. They didn't like what was going on replaced the directors and did extensive reshoots. I'm pretty sure almost everyone involved (Mark Hamills comments aside) made the movie they wanted to make.<br /> <br /> Also, Kennedy never said Leia wouldn't return, just that they wouldn't use CGI to replace her.<br /> <br /> And just to side track a sec, I keep hearing how J.J. had some grand plan for the sequel trilogy. If that's the case then he should have stuck around and directed them all. But, much like Lucas before them, they're just making these up as they go....And don't even try to tell me that Lucas planned out all 9 movies, I love the guy, but it's super obvious he just made up things as he went. I love it...but I'm just saying. As for Disney, they definitely should have mapped out an overarching story for the sequel trilogy, but sadly they didn't. I think going forward with the other Star Wars movies they'll plan things out a bit better. At least you'd hope so...<br /> <br /> That said, I loved just about everything about The Last Jedi and I really like what Disney has been doing with these movies. Sorry you didn't care for it...but hey, to each his own. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://mrgone.rocksolidshells.com/\" target=\"_blank\">MrGone's Character Sheets</a><br /> For all your WoD Character Sheet Needs<br /> _________________________________<br /> Buy books &amp; pdfs from DTRPG and support my web site! <a href=\"http://www.drivethrurpg.com/browse.php?affiliate_id=55414\" target=\"_blank\">Click Here</a><br /> Support my site on Patreon! <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/mrgone\" target=\"_blank\">Click Here</a>","edited":{"userid":24,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24-mr-gone","user":"Mr Gone","date":". 04-13-2019, 05:00 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24-mr-gone","name":"Mr Gone","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2695"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-04-14T15:56:32-07:00","id":1304900,"title":"","content":"I'm happy you liked it, Gone.<br /> <br /> It's clear with have vastly different opinions when it comes to Star Wars, Rian Johnson, and the way studio execs work. And that's cool, too.<br /> <br /> I hope we all can enjoy what looks to be the last Star Wars film for at least a few years.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;quot\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\">&quot;Steel isn't strong, boy. Flesh is stronger.&quot;</span></span></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count"