om/watch?v=8Qn_spdM5Zg\" data-code=\"8Qn_spdM5Zg\" data-provider=\"youtube\" data-height=\"0\" data-width=\"0\" itemprop=\"video\"> <div class=\"videothumbnail\" style=\"\"> <img src=\"https://img.youtube.com/vi/8Qn_spdM5Zg/maxresdefault.jpg\" alt=\"\" /> <div class=\"videothumbnailoverlay\"></div> </div> </a> </div></div> </div> </div> </div>Yeah, I\u2019m here for it!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Going by Willow now, or Wil for short. She/Her/Hers.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/269-charlaquin","name":"Charlaquin","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar269_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10831"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-10-22T19:16:01-07:00","id":1343074,"title":"","content":"On the Frozen hate, I'll admit I don't get it-mostly because I somehow missed the overplay of Let It Go. It'll come up on my playlist, everyone else will groan ask me to skip and I legitimately have to make the argument I haven't heard it that much.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Kelly R.S. Steele, Freelance Writer(Feel free to call me Kelly, Arcane, or Arc)</b><br /> The world is not beautiful, therefore it is.-Keiichi Sigsawa, Kino's Journey<br /> Feminine pronouns, please.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","name":"ArcaneArts","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar99_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11384"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-10-22T19:19:39-07:00","id":1343076,"title":"","content":"Honestly, I think the Frozen overhype ran its course a while ago...or rather, it ran its course as soon as it became apparent people were groaning at the Olaf's Frozen Adventure short in front of Coco.<br /> <br /> I am curious about how Frozen 2 will go...mainly because so far, it seems like they're avoiding trying to rehash the first movie.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4418-tasti-man-lh","name":"tasti man LH","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4418_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1850"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-10-22T19:38:25-07:00","id":1343078,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>ArcaneArts</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/5750-movies?p=1343074#post1343074\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">On the Frozen hate, I'll admit I don't get it-mostly because I somehow missed the overplay of Let It Go. It'll come up on my playlist, everyone else will groan ask me to skip and I legitimately have to make the argument I haven't heard it that much.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Don't know how you managed to achieve that? The song was played just as (if not more) frequently than &quot;My Heart Will Go On&quot; when the Titanic movie came out!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1394-nyrufa","name":"Nyrufa","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1394_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6374"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-10-22T20:28:37-07:00","id":1343084,"title":"","content":"What do you listen to? The only time I've heard out in the 'wild' so to speak was at Disney World. And I've literally been raising a kid since before the movie came out.<br /> <br /> Also if 'hating the MCU' came up because high profile directors like Martin Scorsese and Francis Ford Coppola said they didn't think much of them it's probably less of them being 'DC fans' and more not thinking much of superhero movies and summer blockbusters in general.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather","name":"nofather","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar886_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11016"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-10-22T21:15:09-07:00","id":1343092,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>nofather</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/5750-movies?p=1343084#post1343084\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">What do you listen to? The only time I've heard out in the 'wild' so to speak was at Disney World. And I've literally been raising a kid since before the movie came out.<br /> <br /> Also if 'hating the MCU' came up because high profile directors like Martin Scorsese and Francis Ford Coppola said they didn't think much of them it's probably less of them being 'DC fans' and more not thinking much of superhero movies and summer blockbusters in general.</div> </div> </div> </div>That's one big part of it-I have my various playlist playing tools(including a MP3 player, cause I am old school) that I rely on for the majority of the time in most scenarios.<br /> <br /> ON the Scorsese/Coppola comments:<br /> <br /> First of all, Coppola goes an extra mile in saying that the MCU Films are Despicable, so I just would like to remind people that he made the Robin Williams film Jack, which. Heh.<br /> <br /> Anyways, On Not Cinema-I dunno, since I adopted Scott McCloud's definition of art, I kind of just don't have much use for the &quot;what is art and what isn't art&quot; argument. People have long since tried to use an idea of art to diminish entries into it, but when it's not much to begin with, that argument fails.<br /> <br /> On Despicable, Coppola could have had a good point about it if he went from a production standpoint, because there's a lot messed up about the MCU and Marvel's practices, not the least of which is that Marvel Studios makes sizeable donations to the GOP every year, but he didn't go that way, so we come back around to all the standard stuff which shows up in any number of other media pieces, including some of Coppola's and Scorsese's contributions. So again, kind of a useless statement.<br /> <br /> Like, it's fast food media. We all know that. I need something more than what's been said to give a crap, and you gotta make an argument I haven't heard before, because this is old, <i>old</i> shit.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Kelly R.S. Steele, Freelance Writer(Feel free to call me Kelly, Arcane, or Arc)</b><br /> The world is not beautiful, therefore it is.-Keiichi Sigsawa, Kino's Journey<br /> Feminine pronouns, please.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","name":"ArcaneArts","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar99_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11384"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-10-22T21:59:44-07:00","id":1343097,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>ArcaneArts</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/5750-movies?p=1343092#post1343092\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">ON the Scorsese/Coppola comments:<br /> <br /> First of all, Coppola goes an extra mile in saying that the MCU Films are Despicable, so I just would like to remind people that he made the Robin Williams film Jack, which. Heh.<br /> <br /> Anyways, On Not Cinema-I dunno, since I adopted Scott McCloud's definition of art, I kind of just don't have much use for the &quot;what is art and what isn't art&quot; argument. People have long since tried to use an idea of art to diminish entries into it, but when it's not much to begin with, that argument fails.<br /> <br /> On Despicable, Coppola could have had a good point about it if he went from a production standpoint, because there's a lot messed up about the MCU and Marvel's practices, not the least of which is that Marvel Studios makes sizeable donations to the GOP every year, but he didn't go that way, so we come back around to all the standard stuff which shows up in any number of other media pieces, including some of Coppola's and Scorsese's contributions. So again, kind of a useless statement.<br /> <br /> Like, it's fast food media. We all know that. I need something more than what's been said to give a crap, and you gotta make an argument I haven't heard before, because this is old, <i>old</i> shit.</div> </div> </div> </div>Honestly, I feel like there IS a legitimate point to be made about Scorsese and Coppola's comments about the MCU, and the state of &quot;blockbusters vs everything else&quot; ...I think the issue is that they articulated their point poorly, hence why everyone is jumping down their throats and treating it like they took turns kicking a puppy.<br /> <br /> It's fine to like spectacle movies and the more nuanced...well, for lack of a better term, &quot;art house&quot; movies, but there should be room for both. And it's concerning on the business side of things big companies like Disney are trying to push out the smaller stuff.<br /> <br /> ...for instance, a few weeks ago when I first saw Joker, I saw that one of the rooms was STILL playing Lion King 2019, 3 months after the movie was first released. It's bullshit.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4418-tasti-man-lh","name":"tasti man LH","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4418_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1850"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-10-23T03:17:22-07:00","id":1343112,"title":"","content":"The thing is. most of the mcu isnt fast food media or empty meaningless entertainment. There are depth to them,there sre effort put in them.<br /> The Iron Man trilogy shows how an egotistical selfish person can be redeemed through repentance<br /> Luke Cage and Black Panther clearly discuss the harm Racusm makes and how you can beat it.<br /> Daredevil and Punisher clearly has commentary on the cycle of violence and against corruption in the justice system<br /> Above all else,can anyone deny Jessica Jones was amazing in its commentary about Trauma and Rape Culture?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":4621,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4621-nicolas-milioni","user":"Nicolas Milioni","date":". 10-23-2019, 06:19 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4621-nicolas-milioni","name":"Nicolas Milioni","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4621_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3605"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-10-23T04:31:37-07:00","id":1343123,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Nyrufa</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/5750-movies?p=1343052#post1343052\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><a href=\"https://youtu.be/nB0dE6yCxtM\" target=\"_blank\">LIAR!!!</a><br /></div> </div> </div> </div>Ugh, I am not watching that.<br /> <br /> You know you don't have to watch Star Wars anymore, right? Just because you (and others like you) seem to hate Star Wars now doesn't mean you need to try to ruin it for those of us who do.<br /> <br /> It's been almost 2 years since The Last Jedi came out and y'all are still bitching about it. I see people complaining about it every day. It's crazy to me. It's just a movie guys, Let it go...<br /> <br /> So my advice, since you seem to have already made up your mind about it, is: Just don't watch it and move on from Star Wars.<br /> <br /> It's ok to not like something, but don't try to tell me that I can't.<br /> <br /> The Last Jedi was amazing, the new trailer looks awesome and nothing you say to me is going to make me like it any less.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://mrgone.rocksolidshells.com/\" target=\"_blank\">MrGone's Character Sheets</a><br /> For all your WoD Character Sheet Needs<br /> _________________________________<br /> Buy books &amp; pdfs from DTRPG and support my web site! <a href=\"http://www.drivethrurpg.com/browse.php?affiliate_id=55414\" target=\"_blank\">Click Here</a><br /> Support my site on Patreon! <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/mrgone\" target=\"_blank\">Click Here</a>","edited":{"userid":24,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24-mr-gone","user":"Mr Gone","date":". 10-23-2019, 07:49 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24-mr-gone","name":"Mr Gone","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2695"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-10-23T04:48:12-07:00","id":1343126,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Mr Gone</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/5750-movies?p=1343123#post1343123\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Ugh, I am not watching that.<br /></div> </div> </div> </div><br /> You probably should. Could save you a lot of time and money when / <b>IF</b> the movie releases.<br /> <br /> But if you'd like, I'd be happy to write up the first 5 minutes of his video, word for word!<br /> <br /> We don't hate Star Wars, we hate the talentless hacks who are using Star Wars to shove their political agenda down our throats, and we hate the imbeciles that continue to give them employment contracts! People like you are not fans of the franchise, you're just consumers who will happily buy any crap that has the Star Wars name slapped on to it. And when somebody comes along and tries to provide you with a critical argument, you brush them off without hearing them out, just like you did with the video I linked.<br /> <br /> Rise of Skywalker has had no less than 6 cuts of the movie done so far, and test audiences hated every single one of them. And now, with just barely over 2 months left before release date, they are reshooting over, yes, over 75% of the movie!<br /> <br /> <br /> But since you seem so adamant that the trailer was &quot;amazing&quot; please, tell me what you think is so amazing about it? I am genuinely curious to hear your explanation. Because then I can give you Doomcock's explanation on why the trailer is garbage.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1394,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1394-nyrufa","user":"Nyrufa","date":". 10-23-2019, 08:12 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1394-nyrufa","name":"Nyrufa","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1394_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6374"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-10-23T05:08:50-07:00","id":1343129,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Nyrufa</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/5750-movies?p=1343126#post1343126\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">You probably should. Could save you a lot of time and money when / <b>IF</b> the movie releases.<br /> <br /> But if you'd like, I'd be happy to write up the first 5 minutes of his video, word for word!</div> </div> </div> </div>Nope, no need. I saw the title and it sounds like more hateful Star Wars talk to me based on rumors and leaks that are most likely not true.<br /> <br /> I don't care about anything that video has to say. I don't know anything about the supposed leaks and I don't care. I want to know as little as possible about the movie going in. The trailer looks great and I'm excited to see the movie.<br /> <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://mrgone.rocksolidshells.com/\" target=\"_blank\">MrGone's Character Sheets</a><br /> For all your WoD Character Sheet Needs<br /> _________________________________<br /> Buy books &amp; pdfs from DTRPG and support my web site! <a href=\"http://www.drivethrurpg.com/browse.php?affiliate_id=55414\" target=\"_blank\">Click Here</a><br /> Support my site on Patreon! <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/mrgone\" target=\"_blank\">Click Here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":5}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24-mr-gone","name":"Mr Gone","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2695"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-10-23T05:14:54-07:00","id":1343130,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Nyrufa</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/5750-movies?p=1343126#post1343126\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> <br /> You probably should. Could save you a lot of time and money when / <b>IF</b> the movie releases.<br /> <br /> But if you'd like, I'd be happy to write up the first 5 minutes of his video, word for word!<br /> <br /> We don't hate Star Wars, we hate the talentless hacks who are using Star Wars to shove their political agenda down our throats, and we hate the imbeciles that continue to give them employment contracts! People like you are not fans of the franchise, you're just consumers who will happily buy any crap that has the Star Wars name slapped on to it. And when somebody comes along and tries to provide you with a critical argument, you brush them off without hearing them out, just like you did with the video I linked.<br /> <br /> Rise of Skywalker has had no less than 6 cuts of the movie done so far, and test audiences hated every single one of them. And now, with just barely over 2 months left before release date, they are reshooting over, yes, over 75% of the movie!<br /> <br /> <br /> But since you seem so adamant that the trailer was &amp;quot;amazing&amp;quot; please, tell me what you think is so amazing about it? I am genuinely curious to hear your explanation. Because then I can give you Doomcock's explanation on why the trailer is garbage.</div> </div> </div> </div>Whats the political agenda? Im actually asking in good faith because I'm not the biggest fan of politics in movies most of the time. But at the same time I feel that Star Wars needs to be a little political","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4621-nicolas-milioni","name":"Nicolas Milioni","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4621_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3605"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-10-23T05:15:46-07:00","id":1343131,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Mr Gone</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/5750-movies?p=1343129#post1343129\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Nope, no need. I saw the title and it sounds like more hateful Star Wars talk to me based on rumors and leaks that are most likely not true.<br /> <br /> I don't care about anything that video has to say. I don't know anything about the supposed leaks and I don't care. I want to know as little as possible about the movie going in. The trailer looks great and I'm excited to see the movie.<br /></div> </div> </div> </div><br /> ... Mr. Gone, I don't hate you as a person, I hate that your naivete makes you too stubborn to hear people out when they tell you there is a disaster coming...","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1394-nyrufa","name":"Nyrufa","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1394_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6374"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-10-23T05:26:26-07:00","id":1343134,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Nyrufa</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/5750-movies?p=1343131#post1343131\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">... Mr. Gone, I don't hate you as a person, I hate that your naivete makes you too stubborn to hear people out when they tell you there is a disaster coming...</div> </div> </div> </div>Here's the thing. And I don't know how to say it any other way. It's a movie. It won't be a disaster. You might not like it, but it's only a movie.<br /> <br /> I've loved just about all the Star Wars movie so far, so I have no doubt I'll love this one too. And if I don't, oh well. It's just a movie and it won't be the end of the world. But, something tells me I'm going to enjoy it.<br /> <br /> So, I'm not stubborn or naive. I just like some movies...and if I don't, I just let em go and don't fixate on the things I hate. So...in the immortal words of Luke Skywalker: &quot;Let go of your hate...&quot;<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://mrgone.rocksolidshells.com/\" target=\"_blank\">MrGone's Character Sheets</a><br /> For all your WoD Character Sheet Needs<br /> _________________________________<br /> Buy books &amp; pdfs from DTRPG and support my web site! <a href=\"http://www.drivethrurpg.com/browse.php?affiliate_id=55414\" target=\"_blank\">Click Here</a><br /> Support my site on Patreon! <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/mrgone\" target=\"_blank\">Click Here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":5}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24-mr-gone","name":"Mr Gone","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2695"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-10-23T05:39:04-07:00","id":1343138,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Nicolas Milioni</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/5750-movies?p=1343112#post1343112\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">The thing is. most of the mcu isnt fast food media or empty meaningless entertainment. There are depth to them,there sre effort put in them.</div> </div> </div> </div>The movies may individually have things to say, but their overall place in a massive franchise means the things are said without <i>conviction</i>.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Nicolas Milioni</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/5750-movies?p=1343112#post1343112\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">The Iron Man trilogy shows how an egotistical selfish person can be redeemed through repentance...</div> </div> </div> </div>Iron Man\u2019s presence in the MCU as a whole shows how an egotistical selfish person can <i>say things</i> about redemption and repentance and mean none of it, and people will overlook his obvious double-dealing hypocrisy because he\u2019s a billionaire.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Nicolas Milioni</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/5750-movies?p=1343112#post1343112\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Luke Cage and Black Panther clearly discuss the harm Racusm makes and how you can beat it.</div> </div> </div> </div>Do they?<br /> <br /> The other stuff is all Netflix shows, which only nominally intersects with the MCU films.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>He/him","edited":{"userid":177,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/177-thecountalucard","user":"TheCountAlucard","date":". 10-23-2019, 09:43 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/177-thecountalucard","name":"TheCountAlucard","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar177_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10857"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-10-23T05:55:02-07:00","id":1343141,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Mr Gone</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/5750-movies?p=1343134#post1343134\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Here's the thing. And I don't know how to say it any other way. It's a movie. It won't be a disaster. You might not like it, but it's only a movie.<br /></div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Once again, you are not a fan... you are a consumer.<br /> <br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24-mr-gone\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar24_3.jpg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"24\" data-vbnamecard=\"24\">Mr Gone</a> Anyways, even if YOU don't want to hear his break down, I feel it is my societal duty to help warn others. So here is an <b>exact quote</b> of his break down on the trailer.<br /> <br /> &quot;All across Twitter, I am seeing people saying that for the first time in their lives, they are feeling nothing after seeing the new Rise of Skywalker trailer. Apathy, boredom, malaise. Some are feeling sad at this confirmation of the death of their childhood dreams. Others are laughing, morbidly, at how badly this trailer has failed to spark any kind of excitement... at all. But you're watching this video to find out 2 things. What did Doomcock think about the trailer, and how is Doomcock feeling this morning.&quot;<br /> <br /> &quot; I'm feeling just two things my friends... vindication, and anger. Did this trailer feel disjointed to you? Like a bunch of SVX shots, strung together with no indication at all of what the film is going to be about? Did this trailer about a bunch of placeholder characters doing not much make you feel absolutely nothing whatsoever, except anger and despair? Aside from the fact that Disney's Star Wars is Star Wars in name only, there's another potentially damning reason why this trailer has failed to generate any enthusiasm or excitement. And that reason may well lie in a rumor I reported last week that has exploded over the internet. This trailer told us nothing about the plot of the Rise of Skywalker for one very good reason. Disney can't tell us what the plot of this movie actually is, they're still shooting it!&quot;<br /> <br /> &quot;As incredible as it seems, according to the rumor I initially reported and Midnight's Edge subsequently verified, Disney is reshooting almost ALL of Rise of Skywalker, a mere 64 days ahead of it's Christmas release date. Because even with 6 different cuts of the movie, test audiences hated ALL of them, and Disney is panicking. You see, this is what happens, when you hire a moron, like Jar Jar Abrams who can't write! Jar Jar writes a piece of crap, first draft script, and then convinced of his own genius, he starts filming it. People only start seeing how awful the script is as they're shooting. Then they test the movie with audiences who unlike Jar Jar, actually recognize shit when they step in it. Disney freaks out and orders reshoots. But unfortunately, they get Jar Jar to do the rewrites! He does the rewrites, and because Jar Jar sucks, the rewrites suck again, they shoot them again, they test them again, audiences puke again, Disney wants more reshoots! They hire Jar Jar to rewrite the rewrites that Jar Jar rewrote, Jar Jar isn't a better writer in August than he was in June, so he fucks it up again! Rinse and repeat and then 64 days before your Christmas release, you find yourself desperately doing reshoots to try and make a movie that doesn't suck. And you hire Jar Jar Abrams to fix the movie that Jar Jar Abrams broke!&quot;<br /> <br /> <br /> *skip ahead about a minute and a half*<br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> &quot;The Rise of Skywalker trailer was an empty VFX reel with no discernible plot, because if the rumors are true, and it's increasingly looking like they are at least partially true, Disney doesn't have enough of a film in the can to cut together a coherent trailer. They don't have enough of a narrative completed to offer even a skeleton of an outline in this teaser. And so, claiming they don't wanna show too much of the treasures awaiting you in Rise of Skywalker, they slap whatever special effects shots they're sure will make it into the movie, independent of whatever plot they're cobbling together and hope noone will notice how very little content there is in the trailer. It's very clear, when you think about it.&quot;<br /> <br /> &quot;Consider this: They know for sure that Rey and Kylo are going to bump glowies, no matter what story they actually wind up telling; so they show it. They know it'll be in the water, because those effects are done and since they're just banging sticks together there's no plot to speak of in that scene, so it's safe, so they include it. They know Palpatine will be back, so showing his throne room and the corner of his head in that shot with Rey, that's safe and they pop that in. He laughs like he always laughs 'cause that's what he does, so that's not gonna change, they keep that in. Rey is gonna train with Leia in the jungle, even though Leia isn't a Jedi. That bad writing won't change, check!&quot;<br /> <br /> &quot;All they showed us are the scenes that are locked in.&quot;<br /> <br /> <br /> <b>This is becoming a text wall, so I'm gonna stop here, but I think I've provided enough quotes from him to make my case.</b>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1394,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1394-nyrufa","user":"Nyrufa","date":". 10-23-2019, 09:03 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1394-nyrufa","name":"Nyrufa","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1394_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6374"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-10-23T06:09:35-07:00","id":1343144,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Nyrufa</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/5750-movies?p=1343141#post1343141\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Once again, you are not a fan... you are a consumer.</div> </div> </div> </div>Because I like a movie?<br /> <br /> So because I like the new Star Wars movies I'm not a real fan? Screw that. Thats a fucked up way of thinking. I like what I like... and regardless of what you say, I am a Star Wars fan. Always have been, always will be.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Nyrufa</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/5750-movies?p=1343141#post1343141\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24-mr-gone\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar24_3.jpg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"24\" data-vbnamecard=\"24\">Mr Gone</a> Anyways, even if YOU don't want to hear his break down, I feel it is my societal duty to help warn others.</div> </div> </div> </div>Way to waste your time. I feel sorry for you. It has be horrible to have so much hate for something you supposedly love that you have to go out of your way to try to get other people to hate it too. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/frown.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Frown\" smilieid=\"11\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> I'm not reading that, sorry...<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://mrgone.rocksolidshells.com/\" target=\"_blank\">MrGone's Character Sheets</a><br /> For all your WoD Character Sheet Needs<br /> _________________________________<br /> Buy books &amp; pdfs from DTRPG and support my web site! <a href=\"http://www.drivethrurpg.com/browse.php?affiliate_id=55414\" target=\"_blank\">Click Here</a><br /> Support my site on Patreon! <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/mrgone\" target=\"_blank\">Click Here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":7}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24-mr-gone","name":"Mr Gone","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2695"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-10-23T06:11:29-07:00","id":1343145,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Mr Gone</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/5750-movies?p=1343144#post1343144\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Because I like a movie?<br /> <br /></div> </div> </div> </div>Because you have no actual investment in the movie / franchise, beyond monetary contribution.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1394-nyrufa","name":"Nyrufa","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1394_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6374"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-10-23T06:31:16-07:00","id":1343150,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Nyrufa</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/5750-movies?p=1343145#post1343145\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Because you have no actual investment in the movie / franchise, beyond monetary contribution.</div> </div> </div> </div>Well ... neither do you really.<br /> Unless hating something is a bigger investment in something than liking it. <br /> Which i honestly don't believe it is.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Completed campaign: Scion 2nd Edition. Les L\u00e9gendes Currently playing: Being a dad for a 3 year old daughter and a 2 years old son and now a beautiful new baby.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":5}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11312-maitrecorbo","name":"Maitrecorbo","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11312_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"719"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-10-23T06:50:39-07:00","id":1343155,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Maitrecorbo</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/5750-movies?p=1343150#post1343150\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Well ... neither do you really.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> You could not be any more wrong. A fan, a true FAN of a franchise does not merely shell out money for the next installment and then call it a day. Fans become emotionally and culturally attached to the franchise. We become invested in the series lore, and we use it to disseminate what is officially recognized canon, from what is essentially the work of glorified fanfiction. We grow emotionally attached to the story's <b>characters</b>, not the actors who play them.<br /> <br /> When people think they can come into the picture and start implementing massive, canon breaking changes and justify their actions with &quot;It's just a film / book / est&quot; it is more than a simple disappointment. It is a blatantly offensive insult. If the story, setting, lore and characters can be so radically altered on the shear whims of whoever happens to be writing them at that current moment, then why should the fans even bother giving it their attention? Why should anybody bother giving it their attention?<br /> <br /> They would derive the same impact out of just writing their own story from scratch and claiming that it's an official part of the franchise. Because if the actual writers of the franchise don't give a shit about their work (or the work that came before), then we can not stand there and tell the community that their own work is any less valid to the series going forward.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1394-nyrufa","name":"Nyrufa","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1394_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6374"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-10-23T06:52:29-07:00","id":1343157,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Nyrufa</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.t