ke you I'm not a fan?<br /> <br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Nyrufa</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/5750-movies?p=1343155#post1343155\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">We become invested in the series lore, and we use it to disseminate what is officially recognized canon, from what is essentially the work of glorified fanfiction. We grow emotionally attached to the story's <b>characters</b>, not the actors who play them.</div> </div> </div> </div>Sounds to me like you're too invested to the point of obsession. Like you think you own it. You don't.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Nyrufa</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/5750-movies?p=1343155#post1343155\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">When people think they can come into the picture and start implementing massive, canon breaking changes and justify their actions with &quot;It's just a film / book / est&quot; it is more than a simple disappointment. It is a blatantly offensive insult. If the story, setting, lore and characters can be so radically altered on the shear whims of whoever happens to be writing them at that current moment, then why should the fans even bother giving it their attention? Why should anybody bother giving it their attention?</div> </div> </div> </div>If George Lucas had written these exact movies, do you think you'd be saying the same thing?<br /> <br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Nyrufa</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/5750-movies?p=1343155#post1343155\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">They would derive the same impact out of just writing their own story from scratch and claiming that it's an official part of the franchise. Because if the actual writers of the franchise don't give a shit about their work (or the work that came before), then we can not stand there and tell the community that their own work is any less valid to the series going forward.</div> </div> </div> </div>Why do you think the actual writers of the franchise don't give a shit? Because some rando on the internet says so? Just because you personally don't like what the writers of the franchise have done recently doesn't mean they don't give a shit. It just means you don't like it. They don't owe you anything.<br /> <br /> There are plenty of people who do enjoy these movies and you can't tell us we can't like it. I'm sorry you don't like it, that doesn't mean I can't or that I'm not a &quot;real fan&quot; because I do like it.<br /> <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://mrgone.rocksolidshells.com/\" target=\"_blank\">MrGone's Character Sheets</a><br /> For all your WoD Character Sheet Needs<br /> _________________________________<br /> Buy books &amp; pdfs from DTRPG and support my web site! <a href=\"http://www.drivethrurpg.com/browse.php?affiliate_id=55414\" target=\"_blank\">Click Here</a><br /> Support my site on Patreon! <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/mrgone\" target=\"_blank\">Click Here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24-mr-gone","name":"Mr Gone","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2695"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-10-23T07:26:50-07:00","id":1343168,"title":"","content":"If you don't like something then that just means you're not a fan of it.<br /> Which is why the expression &quot;I'm not a fan of this&quot; exist.<br /> <br /> Feels to me that what hapoenee is that you're no longer a fan of star wars and you have trouble with moving on from that.<br /> For which i feel for you. Ita alwqys sad when you can no longer enjoy something you used to love. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/frown.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Frown\" smilieid=\"11\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> Thankfully we live in a very entertainment rich era so im sure there is many things that will better fit your preferences.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Completed campaign: Scion 2nd Edition. Les L\u00e9gendes Currently playing: Being a dad for a 3 year old daughter and a 2 years old son and now a beautiful new baby.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11312-maitrecorbo","name":"Maitrecorbo","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar11312_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"719"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-10-23T07:35:01-07:00","id":1343171,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Mr Gone</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/5750-movies?p=1343161#post1343161\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> If George Lucas had written these exact movies, do you think you'd be saying the same thing?<br /></div> </div> </div> </div>George Lucas hates these movies as much as we do. He describes his feelings on the matter as &quot;betrayed.&quot; His version of the trilogy was going to explore the story of The Wills (Father, Son and Daughter. You might recognize them from the Clone Wars cartoon). They even decided to buy these stories from him, only to decide they weren't going to use any of them, and gave us this mary sue Rey story.<br /> <br /> The first movie of which was a compiled retelling of the original trilogy. Because for some god forsaken reason, the Star Wars cinematic universe seems absolutely terrified of continuing the story after the defeat of The Empire. Even though there was about 20+ years worth of expanded source material to draw from, they have consistently given us an endless wave of prequels and side-story content, instead of exploring what happens AFTER the Rebels are victorious.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1394-nyrufa","name":"Nyrufa","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1394_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6374"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-10-23T08:12:47-07:00","id":1343178,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Nyrufa</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/5750-movies?p=1343155#post1343155\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">You could not be any more wrong. A fan, a true FAN of a franchise does not merely shell out money for the next installment and then call it a day. Fans become emotionally and culturally attached to the franchise. We become invested in the series lore, and we use it to disseminate what is officially recognized canon, from what is essentially the work of glorified fanfiction. We grow emotionally attached to the story's <b>characters</b>, not the actors who play them.</div> </div> </div> </div>I'm sorry Nyrufa, you're no more or less of a consumer than anyone else. Just because you found someone on YouTube who makes money shitting all over anything new does not give your stance anything stronger foundation to it. You're just another person getting suckered by propaganda.<br /> <br /> I mean, you've made a stance on a movie before you even saw it that's already got you blaming swathes of people over it.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":6}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather","name":"nofather","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar886_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11016"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-10-23T08:14:45-07:00","id":1343179,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>nofather</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/5750-movies?p=1343178#post1343178\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> I'm sorry Nyrufa, you're no more or less of a consumer than anyone else. Just because you found someone on YouTube who makes money shitting all over anything new does not give your stance anything stronger foundation to it. You're just another person getting suckered by propaganda.<br /> <br /> I mean, you've made a stance on a movie before you even saw it that's already got you blaming swathes of people over it.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> You guys seem awfully convinced it's just me and one person doing this. Not surprising, seeing as how Mr. Gone seemed utterly disinterested in hearing the opinions of anybody with any negative feedback to say on the issue.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1394-nyrufa","name":"Nyrufa","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1394_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6374"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-10-23T08:17:03-07:00","id":1343180,"title":"","content":"Here's a short rant, just 3:22, be warned, tons of F-Bombs, so very NSFW<br /> <br /> This rant is basically a truism. It explains why we are getting the story we got. It's like, just a bait and switch story arc. It's not the story of a single, or even a few heroes, it's a story of formulaic balance, just back and forth without being the struggles and triumphs of the protagonists.<br /> <br /> While I still like or don't like the movies apart from this, it makes me feel like the writers were never invested in the story or characters. It's the story of The Force, not any specific player in all the stories<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=wYsnb61JPmM\" target=\"_blank\"> <div class=\"videocontainer with-aspect-ratio videocontainer-horizontal\" style=\"aspect-ratio: 16/9;\"> <a class=\"video-frame\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=wYsnb61JPmM\" data-code=\"wYsnb61JPmM\" data-provider=\"youtube\" data-height=\"0\" data-width=\"0\" itemprop=\"video\"> <div class=\"videothumbnail\" style=\"\"> <img src=\"https://img.youtube.com/vi/wYsnb61JPmM/hqdefault.jpg\" alt=\"\" /> <div class=\"videothumbnailoverlay\"></div> </div> </a> </div></a>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24473-willowfang","name":"Willowfang","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24473_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"92"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-10-23T08:22:17-07:00","id":1343182,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Nyrufa</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/5750-movies?p=1343179#post1343179\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">You guys seem awfully convinced it's just me and one person doing this. Not surprising, seeing as how Mr. Gone seemed utterly disinterested in hearing the opinions of anybody with any negative feedback to say on the issue.</div> </div> </div> </div>Why would I want to hear someone\u2019s negative opinion on something they have not seen yet?<br /> <br />