message\"><br /> Why would I want to hear someone\u2019s negative opinion on something they have not seen yet?<br /> <br /> I don\u2019t understand fans who are constantly negative about something they supposedly like. Seems crazy to me...<br /> <br /> As for George Lucas, I\u2019m sorry he doesn\u2019t like them either. No one forced him to sell the franchise to Disney though. If I remember right, one of the reasons he sold it was because he was tired of negative fans. Ironic...</div> </div> </div> </div>Probably because they're covering the news leading up to the project's official release, and noticing several giant red flags that you might want to be informed about, before deciding to contribute your money to it? They're not behaving any worse than a financial consultant, and outright refusing to hear what they have to say on the matter seems to be stubbornly foolish.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1394-nyrufa","name":"Nyrufa","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1394_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6374"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-10-23T08:43:38-07:00","id":1343187,"title":"","content":"I don\u2019t know what else to say to you. I\u2019ve enjoyed both the Force Awakens and The Last Jedi. I don\u2019t know why that bothers you so much, but I\u2019m sorry. I genuinely feel bad for you.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://mrgone.rocksolidshells.com/\" target=\"_blank\">MrGone's Character Sheets</a><br /> For all your WoD Character Sheet Needs<br /> _________________________________<br /> Buy books &amp; pdfs from DTRPG and support my web site! <a href=\"http://www.drivethrurpg.com/browse.php?affiliate_id=55414\" target=\"_blank\">Click Here</a><br /> Support my site on Patreon! <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/mrgone\" target=\"_blank\">Click Here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":5}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24-mr-gone","name":"Mr Gone","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2695"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-10-23T09:45:45-07:00","id":1343200,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Nyrufa</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/5750-movies?p=1343184#post1343184\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Probably because they're covering the news leading up to the project's official release, and noticing several giant red flags that you might want to be informed about, before deciding to contribute your money to it? They're not behaving any worse than a financial consultant, and outright refusing to hear what they have to say on the matter seems to be stubbornly foolish.</div> </div> </div> </div>Ok, I thought of something else to say. <br /> <br /> Going to a movie isn\u2019t like making a financial investment. When I go see a movie I want to be surprised and entertained. Why would I want to read a bunch of \u201cnews\u201d and watch a bunch of videos that spoil every little thing about the plot before I go see it? I don\u2019t mind knowing a few small things here and there. But, I typically make my decision to see a movie or not based on a trailer. I don\u2019t need to hear a bunch of opinions from random people on the internet about something they haven\u2019t seen yet. I want to experience the story fresh, and then I\u2019ll make up my own mind about it.<br /> <br /> Not everyone is like me though, and that\u2019s ok. So, you\u2019re well within your right to read as much about a movie as you like and form your own opinion. But that\u2019s just it, it\u2019s your opinion, and not everyone thinks the way you do. So please don\u2019t tell me I can\u2019t or shouldn\u2019t enjoy something just because you don\u2019t. You\u2019re not \u201csaving\u201d anyone, you\u2019re just being as asshole.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://mrgone.rocksolidshells.com/\" target=\"_blank\">MrGone's Character Sheets</a><br /> For all your WoD Character Sheet Needs<br /> _________________________________<br /> Buy books &amp; pdfs from DTRPG and support my web site! <a href=\"http://www.drivethrurpg.com/browse.php?affiliate_id=55414\" target=\"_blank\">Click Here</a><br /> Support my site on Patreon! <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/mrgone\" target=\"_blank\">Click Here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":5}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24-mr-gone","name":"Mr Gone","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2695"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-10-23T10:33:56-07:00","id":1343208,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Nyrufa</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/5750-movies?p=1343179#post1343179\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">You guys seem awfully convinced it's just me and one person doing this. Not surprising, seeing as how Mr. Gone seemed utterly disinterested in hearing the opinions of anybody with any negative feedback to say on the issue.</div> </div> </div> </div>No one thinks blaming liberals because things now aren't like they were in the 70s is just you. You're just a noticeable representative because you buy into it all and bring the soapboxes here to stand on.<br /> <br /> From its start Star Wars has been designed for mass appeal. Mass appeal now includes international market, where China dominates. Liberal and progressives in China aren't doubling the domestic profits overseas, no matter how much your favorite Youtuber wants to whine about them.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":5}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather","name":"nofather","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar886_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11016"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-10-23T11:23:55-07:00","id":1343222,"title":"","content":"I'll admit, I stopped listening to Nyr-well actually, I put him on ignore a while ago because I finally just got disgusted by him, but as much as I can see him in this conversation-<br /> <br /> I stopped listening to Nyr the instant this &quot;True Fan&quot; bullshit started because WOW that is such code for &quot;Mine (and anyone who agrees with me) is the only opinion that matters!&quot; I know Star Wars fans who have entire houses built to theme who love the new trilogy, I also know Star Wars fans who have entire houses built to theme who hate the new trilogy. I've heard enough variations amongst True Fans that I'm just gonna reach my own conclusions on whether to watch something or not.<br /> <br /> In the mean time, I live on basically no money right now, so movies are a general no unless I'm willing to chop money out of the food budget for it*.<br /> <br /> I'm not a true fan, and I already don't just watch things because they're the pop cultural talk before accounting for my economic state, but Last Jedi got me feeling like a kid enough that I am currently figuring out December for RoS.<br /> <br /> Anyways, we've done this song and dance before, so maybe we don't keep doing it? <br /> <br /> *or if someone takes me to a movie, as happened with Joker, even though <i>I kinda didn't want to</i>.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Kelly R.S. Steele, Freelance Writer(Feel free to call me Kelly, Arcane, or Arc)</b><br /> The world is not beautiful, therefore it is.-Keiichi Sigsawa, Kino's Journey<br /> Feminine pronouns, please.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","name":"ArcaneArts","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar99_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11384"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-10-23T11:24:55-07:00","id":1343223,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>nofather</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/5750-movies?p=1343208#post1343208\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> No one thinks blaming liberals because things now aren't like they were in the 70s is just you. You're just a noticeable representative because you buy into it all and bring the soapboxes here to stand on.<br /> <br /> From its start Star Wars has been designed for mass appeal. Mass appeal now includes international market, where China dominates. Liberal and progressives in China aren't doubling the domestic profits overseas, no matter how much your favorite Youtuber wants to whine about them.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> At what point in this conversation did I even remotely mention China? Or claim anybody was my favorite youtuber? I'm simply paying attention to the public opinion going on in regards to the current topic, and it seems the overwhelming majority are unhappy with the situation. While anybody who would fight in support of the changes being made can do not but spout the same recycled rhetoric about how the people who don't like it are nothing more than (insert name of bigot group you don't like here), while offering nothing in the way of legitimate points to support their side of the debate.<br /> <br /> I find it impossible to take anyone on your side seriously, when they outright refuse to listen to anybody on my side. Or in the case of ArcaneArts, flat out put me on the ignore list. That is not the stance of somebody looking to engage in a mature discussion on the issue. That is the stance of a child who covers their ears and paces around the room yelling &quot;nah nah nah nah!&quot; because they don't want to hear how bad the situation is.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24-mr-gone\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar24_3.jpg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"24\" data-vbnamecard=\"24\">Mr Gone</a> That's fine. I know I can't stop you from going to see the movie, and it would be ridiculous to try. I was simply trying to provide you fair warning ahead of time. A warning you clearly don't want to even acknowledge.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1394,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1394-nyrufa","user":"Nyrufa","date":". 10-23-2019, 02:31 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1394-nyrufa","name":"Nyrufa","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1394_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6374"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-10-23T11:39:03-07:00","id":1343227,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Nyrufa</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/5750-movies?p=1343223#post1343223\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I was simply trying to provide you fair warning ahead of time. A warning you clearly don't want to even acknowledge.</div> </div> </div> </div>...a warning that nobody asked for that you dropped in unsolicited?<br /> <br /> Riiight...","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":8}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4418-tasti-man-lh","name":"tasti man LH","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4418_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1850"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-10-23T11:42:06-07:00","id":1343231,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>tasti man LH</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/5750-movies?p=1343227#post1343227\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> ...a warning that nobody asked for that you dropped in unsolicited?<br /> <br /> Riiight...</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> A warning to claiming the trailer looks awesome, and a link to a video fully explaining why the trailer was little more than a bare bones special effects demo.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1394-nyrufa","name":"Nyrufa","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1394_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6374"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-10-23T12:00:46-07:00","id":1343236,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Nyrufa</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/5750-movies?p=1343231#post1343231\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> <br /> A warning to claiming the trailer looks awesome, and a link to a video fully explaining why the trailer was little more than a bare bones special effects demo.</div> </div> </div> </div>So.<br /> <br /> A warning that nobody asked for that you dropped in unsolicited.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":8}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4418-tasti-man-lh","name":"tasti man LH","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4418_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1850"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-10-23T12:09:20-07:00","id":1343237,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>tasti man LH</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/5750-movies?p=1343236#post1343236\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> So.<br /> <br /> A warning that nobody asked for that you dropped in unsolicited.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> To prevent the possible spread of misinformation?<br /> <br /> Meh, my conscience is clean.<br /> <br /> At any rate, I believe this discussion between me and Mr. Gone is already settled.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1394-nyrufa","name":"Nyrufa","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1394_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6374"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-10-23T12:18:57-07:00","id":1343238,"title":"","content":"I'm sorry, I gotta laugh because I remember when the Star Wars fandom geeked out over <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=8NE5elL30w4\" target=\"_blank\">Ryan vs Dorkman</a>, which is literally just a bare bones special effects demo.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Kelly R.S. Steele, Freelance Writer(Feel free to call me Kelly, Arcane, or Arc)</b><br /> The world is not beautiful, therefore it is.-Keiichi Sigsawa, Kino's Journey<br /> Feminine pronouns, please.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","name":"ArcaneArts","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar99_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11384"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-10-23T12:57:47-07:00","id":1343247,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Nyrufa</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/5750-movies?p=1343223#post1343223\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">At what point in this conversation did I even remotely mention China? Or claim anybody was my favorite youtuber? I'm simply paying attention to the public opinion going on in regards to the current topic, and it seems the overwhelming majority are unhappy with the situation. While anybody who would fight in support of the changes being made can do not but spout the same recycled rhetoric about how the people who don't like it are nothing more than (insert name of bigot group you don't like here), while offering nothing in the way of legitimate points to support their side of the debate.</div> </div> </div> </div>You not mentioning China here was my point. You claim to pay attention to public opinion, but you're ignoring more than half the audience.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> I find it impossible to take anyone on your side seriously, when they outright refuse to listen to anybody on my side. Or in the case of ArcaneArts, flat out put me on the ignore list. That is not the stance of somebody looking to engage in a mature discussion on the issue. That is the stance of a child who covers their ears and paces around the room yelling &quot;nah nah nah nah!&quot; because they don't want to hear how bad the situation is. </div> </div> </div>It's a movie. It's not a bad situation for anyone actually involved with it. Combined the sequels and their spinoffs have made almost 5 billion dollars, solely based on movie sales (again, more than half in China).<br /> <br /> I've stated before likely in this thread (if not, the Star Wars one), I don't care about Star Wars. I'm not a fan, and given a choice between seeing them and taking a nap I'd rather take a nap.<br /> <br /> But you're acting like the sky is falling, calling it a disaster, even making up sides so you can have someone to rail against. The Star Wars movies were always about one thing. Making money. You can blame 'the talentless hacks who are using Star Wars to shove their political agenda down our throats' all you want, but their only agenda is more money through a movie as entertaining as possible to the broadest possible audience, at least half of whom don't know or care about the political agenda you're so scared of.<br /> <br /> You have <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/1167544-star-wars-the-last-jedi?p=1235873#post1235873\">the same point you did the last time</a>. You hate these movies you haven't seen. You blame 'SJW's. You wrongly think the movies are doing badly financially in the States. You wrongly think they're doing badly financially in China. You wrongly think Disney is losing money because of them. You wrongly said someone here wasn't a true fan because you care more, even though you've spent literally over a year here doing nothing but talking trash about them.<br /> <br /> You say 'my side' is acting like a child ignoring everything around them? Look at your own posts a year ago and before over a billion dollars in profits. You've been crying the same thing then as you are now, ignoring reality.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":10}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather","name":"nofather","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar886_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11016"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-10-23T13:01:46-07:00","id":1343248,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>nofather</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/5750-movies?p=1343247#post1343247\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> You not mentioning China here was my point. You claim to pay attention to public opinion, but you're ignoring more than half the audience.</div> </div> </div> </div>No, I'm fully aware of the China marketing situation, I simply didn't think it had any relevance to a conversation about the lack of content in the trailer, and the claims that they are reshooting over 75% of the movie just 64 days before release.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> It's a movie. It's not a bad situation for anyone actually involved with it. Combined the sequels and their spinoffs have made almost 5 billion dollars, solely based on movie sales (again, more than half in China). </div> </div> </div>The situation is this: They need this movie to get people hyped up to see more Star Wars content in the future. And after 6 cuts of the movie, test audiences hated ALL of them. When Disney purchased Lucas Films, they <b>deliberately over paid</b> for it by nearly 1.5 billion dollars of what it was actually worth. And now that the new trilogy has received such backlash, they're panicking. This movie is their last chance to salvage the future of the franchise, and desperately try to at the very least break even with what they paid for.<br /> <br /> If Disney was actually doing well with these franchises, then why are the audience review scores for them at rock bottom? Why are review sites like Rotten Tomatoes going to great lengths to interfere with audience review scores? Even going so far as to disable the option when it didn't meet the percentage they were hoping for?<br /> <br /> Why is youtube secretly removing subscribers from review channels under the pretense of them being spam accounts, while the Rise of Skywalker trailer get nearly 150k upvotes <b>almost</b> <b>immediately</b> after being uploaded to youtube? That sounds like the work of spam accounts.<br /> <br /> <br /> You stated that I wasn't keeping myself in the loop, but it's quite the opposite. By refusing to listen to those who have an unfavorable opinion about the topic at hand, you remain blissfully ignorant to the problem, even as it continues to grow. The point of having a civilized debate isn't angrily screaming your opinion at the other person until one of you finally becomes too exhausted to continue.<br /> <br /> It involves explaining your side of the argument to the other party in as cohesive a manner as possible, in the hopes of convincing them to see why your side might have more merit. And I will be the first to admit that I'm not as fully informed about the deeper situation as I would like to be. That is why I am watching videos of other people who actually have done the research, and why I decided to link one of them.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"videocontainer with-aspect-ratio videocontainer-horizontal\" style=\"aspect-ratio: 16/9;\"> <a class=\"video-frame\" href=\"https://youtu.be/pWyDRiGli78\" data-code=\"pWyDRiGli78\" data-provider=\"youtube_share\" data-height=\"0\" data-width=\"0\" itemprop=\"video\"> <div class=\"videothumbnail\" style=\"\"> <img src=\"https://img.youtube.com/vi/pWyDRiGli78/maxresdefault.jpg\" alt=\"\" /> <div class=\"videothumbnailoverlay\"></div> </div> </a> </div><br /> <br /> Edit: You claim that the franchise is still making money. You claim that people are still excited for new releases. And yet, when I try to provide hard, concrete evidence to the contrary (like those 3 videos which showed that the same exact merchandise was gathering dust on the shelves for months on end because nobody wanted it), you immediately decide to shoot it down without giving it so much as a second glance.<br /> <br /> So yes, I believe calling such people children is very much accurate. I have done you the courtesy of hearing out your side of the issue, but you have thus far refused to extend the same courtesy to me. The video I linked up above details an article which outright confirms that Star Wars is making less money, not more. And if you're not even going to watch it, then don't bother responding to me. I don't want to debate with somebody who only wants to hear their own voice and the voices of those who agree with them.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1394,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1394-nyrufa","user":"Nyrufa","date":". 10-23-2019, 04:49 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1394-nyrufa","name":"Nyrufa","