blank\">radicalizing Gabe</a> than anything else.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Going by Willow now, or Wil for short. She/Her/Hers.","edited":{"userid":269,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/269-charlaquin","user":"Charlaquin","date":". 10-23-2019, 08:19 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/269-charlaquin","name":"Charlaquin","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar269_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10831"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-10-23T17:08:12-07:00","id":1343302,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Charlaquin</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/5750-movies?p=1343300#post1343300\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> I mean, in truth complaints about \u201cagendas\u201d in popular media are really more about <a href=\"http://&quot;https://youtu.be/P55t6eryY3g\" target=\"_blank\">radicalizing Gabe</a> than anything else.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> link's broken. Could you just tl;dr what the video's about? Is it about the idea of convincing people that only stuff with social messaging you disagree with has a &quot;political agenda&quot; while works that promote your preferred belief system are purely apolitical?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>A god is just a monster you kneel to. </b>- ArcaneArts, Quoting &quot;Fall of Gods&quot; <div align=\"center\"><a href=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/personality.htm\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/pub/6.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a> </div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7920-master-aquatosic","name":"Master Aquatosic","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7920_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2369"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-10-23T17:21:00-07:00","id":1343306,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Master Aquatosic</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/5750-movies?p=1343302#post1343302\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">link's broken. Could you just tl;dr what the video's about? Is it about the idea of convincing people that only stuff with social messaging you disagree with has a &amp;quot;political agenda&amp;quot; while works that promote your preferred belief system are purely apolitical?</div> </div> </div> </div>Should work now. It\u2019s more generally about how the alt right radicalizes otherwise reasonable people in online spaces, but what you say here is one of the many points raised in it, and it\u2019s the part I was referring to.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Going by Willow now, or Wil for short. She/Her/Hers.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/269-charlaquin","name":"Charlaquin","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar269_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10831"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-10-23T17:29:16-07:00","id":1343308,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Nyrufa</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/5750-movies?p=1343237#post1343237\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">At any rate, I believe this discussion between me and Mr. Gone is already settled.</div> </div> </div> </div>Oh yea! We're done.<br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> Well.....maybe not quite.<br /> <br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Nyrufa</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/5750-movies?p=1343248#post1343248\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I simply didn't think it had any relevance to a conversation about the lack of content in the trailer, and the claims that they are reshooting over 75% of the movie just 64 days before release.</div> </div> </div> </div>&quot;Claims&quot;? Some people on YouTube you mean said 75% is being reshot? Do they work for Disney/Lucasfilm on this movie? If not, then they don't know...<br /> <br /> But, I will say this, reshoots happen with movies ALL THE TIME. Reshoots don't mean or prove anything.<br /> <br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Nyrufa</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/5750-movies?p=1343248#post1343248\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">The situation is this: They need this movie to get people hyped up to see more Star Wars content in the future. And after 6 cuts of the movie, test audiences hated ALL of them. When Disney purchased Lucas Films, they <b>deliberately over paid</b> for it by nearly 1.5 billion dollars of what it was actually worth. And now that the new trilogy has received such backlash, they're panicking. This movie is their last chance to salvage the future of the franchise, and desperately try to at the very least break even with what they paid for.</div> </div> </div> </div>How do you know they &quot;deliberately over paid&quot;? Again, because of some guy on YouTube? Pretty sure I remember hearing they paid like 4 billion, and I'm pretty sure they've made that back. They're spending money on the franchise, but I'm pretty sure they made their money back from that 4B and then some.<br /> <br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Nyrufa</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/5750-movies?p=1343248#post1343248\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">If Disney was actually doing well with these franchises, then why are the audience review scores for them at rock bottom? Why are review sites like Rotten Tomatoes going to great lengths to interfere with audience review scores? Even going so far as to disable the option when it didn't meet the percentage they were hoping for?<br /> <br /> Why is youtube secretly removing subscribers from review channels under the pretense of them being spam accounts, while the Rise of Skywalker trailer get nearly 150k upvotes <b>almost</b> <b>immediately</b> after being uploaded to youtube? That sounds like the work of spam accounts.</div> </div> </div> </div>That is crazy. You know that sounds super paranoid, right?<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Nyrufa</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/5750-movies?p=1343248#post1343248\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">By refusing to listen to those who have an unfavorable opinion about the topic at hand, you remain blissfully ignorant to the problem, even as it continues to grow.</div> </div> </div> </div>What problem?<br /> <br /> And I don't refuse to listen to people with an unfavorable opinion. I've just heard you and people like you bitch about Star Wars for more than 2 years and I'm tired of it.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://mrgone.rocksolidshells.com/\" target=\"_blank\">MrGone's Character Sheets</a><br /> For all your WoD Character Sheet Needs<br /> _________________________________<br /> Buy books &amp; pdfs from DTRPG and support my web site! <a href=\"http://www.drivethrurpg.com/browse.php?affiliate_id=55414\" target=\"_blank\">Click Here</a><br /> Support my site on Patreon! <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/mrgone\" target=\"_blank\">Click Here</a>","edited":{"userid":24,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24-mr-gone","user":"Mr Gone","date":". 10-26-2019, 08:35 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":6}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24-mr-gone","name":"Mr Gone","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2695"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-10-23T17:39:11-07:00","id":1343311,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Mr Gone</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/5750-movies?p=1343308#post1343308\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> <br /> <br /> &quot;Claims&quot;? Some people on YouTube you mean said 75% is being reshot? Do they work for Disney/Lucasfilm on this movie? If not, then they don't know...</div> </div> </div> </div>As a matter of fact, at least one of their sources DOES work on the Rise of Skywalker crew, and you would have known that, if you watched the video.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Mr Gone</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/5750-movies?p=1343308#post1343308\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> <br /> How do you know they &quot;deliberately over paid&quot;? Again, because of some guy on YouTube? Pretty sure I remember hearing they paid like 4 billion, and I'm pretty sure they've made that back. They're spending money on the franchise, but I'm pretty sure they made their money back from that 4B and then some.<br /> <br /> <br /></div> </div> </div> </div>Because it was estimated to be around 3.5 billion in worth, and they paid roughly 5 billion.<br /> <br /> According to you, they've made back around 5 billion, right? Meaning that they've pretty much broke even with Episodes 7, 8, Solo and Rogue 1 all together?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1394,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1394-nyrufa","user":"Nyrufa","date":". 10-23-2019, 08:46 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1394-nyrufa","name":"Nyrufa","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1394_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6374"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-10-23T19:20:44-07:00","id":1343320,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Nyrufa</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/5750-movies?p=1343311#post1343311\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">As a matter of fact, at least one of their sources DOES work on the Rise of Skywalker crew, and you would have known that, if you watched the video.</div> </div> </div> </div>Interesting.<br /> <br /> But, doesn't change the fact that just about every big movie does reshoots. So that still doesn't mean anything....<br /> <br /> Plus, again, I'm not going to watch your hateful videos because I don't the new movie spoiled for me. So, I'll decide what I think about it once I see the movie, not before.<br /> <br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Nyrufa</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/5750-movies?p=1343311#post1343311\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Because it was estimated to be around 3.5 billion in worth, and they paid roughly 5 billion.<br /> <br /> According to you, they've made back around 5 billion, right? Meaning that they've pretty much broke even with Episodes 7, 8, Solo and Rogue 1 all together?</div> </div> </div> </div>So? What does it even matter how much money they make?<br /> <br /> <br /> All I care about is are the movies any good, and to me they are. What else do I need to say? As a Star Wars fan my entire life, I love what the new movies. Sorry that you don't.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://mrgone.rocksolidshells.com/\" target=\"_blank\">MrGone's Character Sheets</a><br /> For all your WoD Character Sheet Needs<br /> _________________________________<br /> Buy books &amp; pdfs from DTRPG and support my web site! <a href=\"http://www.drivethrurpg.com/browse.php?affiliate_id=55414\" target=\"_blank\">Click Here</a><br /> Support my site on Patreon! <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/mrgone\" target=\"_blank\">Click Here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24-mr-gone","name":"Mr Gone","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2695"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-10-23T19:41:40-07:00","id":1343325,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Mr Gone</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/5750-movies?p=1343320#post1343320\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Plus, again, I'm not going to watch your hateful videos because I don't the new movie spoiled for me. So, I'll decide what I think about it once I see the movie, not before.<br /></div> </div> </div> </div>They aren't spoiling the movie for you, though. The video is talking about the trailer itself. There are no spoilers that Doomcock addresses in that video that you did not already see by watching the trailer itself. That's what a &quot;break down&quot; video means. They analyze the content of what has been shown, and then critique it for the audience.<br /> <br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <span style=\"color:#252C2F\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:13px\">All I care about is are the movies any good, and to me they are.</span></span></span> </div> </div> </div><span style=\"color:#252C2F\"><span style=\"font-family:Helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:13px\">Which is fine, and why I said the matter between us was already settled.</span></span></span>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1394,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1394-nyrufa","user":"Nyrufa","date":". 10-23-2019, 10:45 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theo