ignature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1394-nyrufa","name":"Nyrufa","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1394_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6374"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-10-23T20:46:31-07:00","id":1343337,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Master Aquatosic</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/5750-movies?p=1343333#post1343333\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">then why are you still posting about it 8 hours after you declared the matter settled?</div> </div> </div> </div>It seems to be a day for it.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Kelly R.S. Steele, Freelance Writer(Feel free to call me Kelly, Arcane, or Arc)</b><br /> The world is not beautiful, therefore it is.-Keiichi Sigsawa, Kino's Journey<br /> Feminine pronouns, please.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","name":"ArcaneArts","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar99_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11384"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-10-23T20:57:32-07:00","id":1343341,"title":"","content":"<i>sigh</i><br /> <br /> On another topic, any good CoD inspirational horror movies come out for someone who hates jump scares and is probably more scared by the music and sound than the visuals?<br /> <br /> Cannot stress enough how much I despise jump scares. They are cheap and lazy &quot;horror&quot; but they also scare me every time in an unfun way","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>A god is just a monster you kneel to. </b>- ArcaneArts, Quoting &quot;Fall of Gods&quot; <div align=\"center\"><a href=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/personality.htm\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://www.nodiatis.com/pub/6.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a> </div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7920-master-aquatosic","name":"Master Aquatosic","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7920_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2369"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-10-23T21:53:28-07:00","id":1343346,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Master Aquatosic</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/5750-movies?p=1343341#post1343341\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><i>sigh</i><br /> <br /> On another topic, any good CoD inspirational horror movies come out for someone who hates jump scares and is probably more scared by the music and sound than the visuals?<br /> <br /> Cannot stress enough how much I despise jump scares. They are cheap and lazy &quot;horror&quot; but they also scare me every time in an unfun way</div> </div> </div> </div>Oculus and Us are the big ones I can think of, though those might still be a little too jumpy.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Kelly R.S. Steele, Freelance Writer(Feel free to call me Kelly, Arcane, or Arc)</b><br /> The world is not beautiful, therefore it is.-Keiichi Sigsawa, Kino's Journey<br /> Feminine pronouns, please.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","name":"ArcaneArts","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar99_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11384"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-10-23T23:59:35-07:00","id":1343354,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Master Aquatosic</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/5750-movies?p=1343341#post1343341\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">On another topic, any good CoD inspirational horror movies come out for someone who hates jump scares and is probably more scared by the music and sound than the visuals?<br /> <br /> Cannot stress enough how much I despise jump scares. They are cheap and lazy &quot;horror&quot; but they also scare me every time in an unfun way</div> </div> </div> </div>I don't recall any jumpscares in Unsane, but it's a pretty grim movie. I mentioned it briefly <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/5750-movies?p=1252438#post1252438\">here</a>.<br /> <br /> But they seem like they're not going away. I always recommend Asmodexia, but it's been so long since I saw it I don't remember if there were any there, either. Belzebuth is good but has a couple mid-movie.<br /> <br /> They're less common in classics. Just watched Invasion of the Blood Farmers and there were none in it, but it's not what I'd consider a good movie. It has some interesting enough ideas in it they should do a modern remake, though.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather","name":"nofather","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar886_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11016"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-10-24T01:41:15-07:00","id":1343359,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Nyrufa</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/5750-movies?p=1343126#post1343126\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> <br /> You probably should. Could save you a lot of time and money when / <b>IF</b> the movie releases.<br /> <br /> But if you'd like, I'd be happy to write up the first 5 minutes of his video, word for word!<br /> <br /> We don't hate Star Wars, we hate the talentless hacks who are using Star Wars to shove their political agenda down our throats, and we hate the imbeciles that continue to give them employment contracts! People like you are not fans of the franchise, you're just consumers who will happily buy any crap that has the Star Wars name slapped on to it. And when somebody comes along and tries to provide you with a critical argument, you brush them off without hearing them out, just like you did with the video I linked.<br /> <br /> Rise of Skywalker has had no less than 6 cuts of the movie done so far, and test audiences hated every single one of them. And now, with just barely over 2 months left before release date, they are reshooting over, yes, over 75% of the movie!<br /> <br /> <br /> But since you seem so adamant that the trailer was &quot;amazing&quot; please, tell me what you think is so amazing about it? I am genuinely curious to hear your explanation. Because then I can give you Doomcock's explanation on why the trailer is garbage.</div> </div> </div> </div><b><span style=\"color:#B22222\">A group and a personal attack? Okay, you need some time off. </span></b><br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b><a href=\"https://swordofcreation.net/\" target=\"_blank\">Sword of Creation</a> a hub for Exalted related content</b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7-lioness","name":"Lioness","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7_2.png","title":"Moderator","rank":6,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5443"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-10-24T03:05:23-07:00","id":1343369,"title":"","content":"So\u2026<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Nicolas Milioni</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/5750-movies?p=1343112#post1343112\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">The thing is. most of the mcu isnt fast food media or empty meaningless entertainment.</div> </div> </div> </div>I actually disagree that it being the media equivalent of \u201cfast food\u201d would make it meaningless; even fast food can have a sinister agenda.<br /> <br /> Chik-Fil-A, for example, consistently throws money at anti-LGBT organizations. Wendy\u2019s has a Twitter cranking out jokes 24/7 because the alternative buzz they\u2019d get is the revelation that <a href=\"https://www.nytimes.com/2019/03/07/business/economy/wendys-farm-workers-tomatoes.html\" target=\"_blank\">they\u2019re profiting from violence and sexual harassment on the farms where they get their tomatoes.</a> KFC wants you to think about their new dating sim, not the time they decided the best way to advertise their new chicken was to have a black woman give away coupons for it on TV (and how the franchises weren\u2019t actually prepared to meet the demand).<br /> <br /> And so, too, are these superhero movies pretty political when you step back and look at them. Others have pointed out earlier that the philosophy of Thanos is very much like Malthus; I'd like to emphasize how characters in <i>Infinity War</i> are quick to call him monstrous for his plan to wipe out half of all life, but nobody bothers to tell Thanos that his plan is <b>factually wrong</b>.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>He/him","edited":{"userid":177,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/177-thecountalucard","user":"TheCountAlucard","date":". 10-24-2019, 10:17 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/177-thecountalucard","name":"TheCountAlucard","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar177_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10857"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-10-24T04:57:13-07:00","id":1343382,"title":"","content":"I kno