343341\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><i>sigh</i><br /> <br /> On another topic, any good CoD inspirational horror movies come out for someone who hates jump scares and is probably more scared by the music and sound than the visuals?<br /> <br /> Cannot stress enough how much I despise jump scares. They are cheap and lazy &amp;quot;horror&amp;quot; but they also scare me every time in an unfun way</div> </div> </div> </div>The Void, Violent Kind, Hellraiser: Deader, Inferno and Hellseeker come to mind for non jump scare horror.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3953-dwight","name":"Dwight","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3953_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2355"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-10-25T15:35:44-07:00","id":1343670,"title":"","content":"JoJo Rabbit is an amazing film, it has comedy, tragedy and a wonderful ending. I really hope it cleans up in award season.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3953-dwight","name":"Dwight","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3953_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2355"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-10-26T17:45:56-07:00","id":1343892,"title":"","content":"<br /> Wow, I really let that Star Wars thing get out of hand. Sorry about that... I forgot I got into with that guy about basically the exact same thing last time. I shouldn't have engaged...<img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/frown.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Frown\" smilieid=\"11\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Master Aquatosic</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/5750-movies?p=1343341#post1343341\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><i>sigh</i><br /> <br /> On another topic, any good CoD inspirational horror movies come out for someone who hates jump scares and is probably more scared by the music and sound than the visuals?<br /> <br /> Cannot stress enough how much I despise jump scares. They are cheap and lazy &quot;horror&quot; but they also scare me every time in an unfun way</div> </div> </div> </div>While it may have one or two jump scares, It Follows is a pretty great atmospheric horror movie...for the most part. I think it was my favorite of the year, and maybe my favorite horror movie of the last few years. So, if you haven't seen it I think it'd be worth a watch.<br /> <br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>TheCountAlucard</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/5750-movies?p=1343369#post1343369\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">And so, too, are these superhero movies pretty political when you step back and look at them. Others have pointed out earlier that the philosophy of Thanos is very much like Malthus; I'd like to emphasize how characters in <i>Infinity War</i> are quick to call him monstrous for his plan to wipe out half of all life, but nobody bothers to tell Thanos that his plan is <b>factually wrong</b>.</div> </div> </div> </div>Yea, I mean, if you have essentially infinite power, you could just create more resources for people...<br /> <br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Dwight</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/5750-movies?p=1343670#post1343670\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">JoJo Rabbit is an amazing film, it has comedy, tragedy and a wonderful ending. I really hope it cleans up in award season.</div> </div> </div> </div>I really want to see it!! I've heard nothing but good things! I've been looking forward to it. It and Knives Out! I can't wait to see that!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://mrgone.rocksolidshells.com/\" target=\"_blank\">MrGone's Character Sheets</a><br /> For all your WoD Character Sheet Needs<br /> _________________________________<br /> Buy books &amp; pdfs from DTRPG and support my web site! <a href=\"http://www.drivethrurpg.com/browse.php?affiliate_id=55414\" target=\"_blank\">Click Here</a><br /> Support my site on Patreon! <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/mrgone\" target=\"_blank\">Click Here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24-mr-gone","name":"Mr Gone","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2695"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-10-26T17:53:57-07:00","id":1343893,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Mr Gone</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/5750-movies?p=1343892#post1343892\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Yea, I mean, if you have essentially infinite power, you could just create more resources for people...</div> </div> </div> </div>Honestly, creating more resources <i>ex nihilo</i> wouldn't solve the problem either; we already <i>produce</i> more than enough food. Currently production is sufficient to feed every man, woman, and child on the planet, with enough left over to feed <i>billions more</i>, and instead <b>we destroy food to keep it scarce, so the rich get richer.</b>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>He/him","edited":{"userid":177,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/177-thecountalucard","user":"TheCountAlucard","date":". 10-26-2019, 08:57 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/177-thecountalucard","name":"TheCountAlucard","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar177_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10857"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-10-26T18:05:55-07:00","id":1343898,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> 